#: assets/maps/story/t2_01.tmx:
msgid "WATERY CRYPT – B1F"
msgstr "Wasserkrypta – 1. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t2_01.tmx:
msgid "We are underground."
msgstr "Wir sind im Untergrund."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "City Hall"
msgstr "Rathaus"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "This place smells good."
msgstr "Dieser Ort riecht gut."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "…"
msgstr "…"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "H-hello."
msgstr "S.. Seid Gegrüßt."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Hello, you must be {{hero}}! Nice to meet you.\nI heard you were heading to these parts.\nMy name is Xe III and I am the King of this Region."
msgstr "Hallo, du musst {{hero}} sein!\nSchön Dich kennen zu lernen. Ich hörte schon, dass Du in diese Gegend kommst.\nMein Name ist Xe III. Ich bin der König hier."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "king"
msgstr "König"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Do not confuse me with the King of Evil, I'm not a bad guy haha."
msgstr "Verwechsle mich nicht mit dem König des Bösen, ich bin kein schlechter Kerl haha."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "So… tell me, how are you? Is everything okay? How is the journey going?"
msgstr "Also, wie geht es Dir? Ist alles in Ordnung? Wie läuft die Reise?"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Everything good, I just got the first signet!"
msgstr "Alles in Ordnung, ich habe gerade das erste Siegel geholt!"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Oh really?! This is great news!"
msgstr "Oh, wirklich?! Das sind ja tolle Neuigkeiten!"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "It has been difficult?"
msgstr "Ist es schwierig gewesen?"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Well, but if you did it, it means that you are strong!"
msgstr "Schon, aber da Du es geschafft hast bedeutet das, dass Du stark bist!"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Well, congratulations! This means that you are strong!"
msgstr "Nun, Glückwunsch! Das bedeutet, dass Du stark bist!"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "I trust that you will be able to take the other two signets as well."
msgstr "Ich vertraue darauf, dass Du die anderen beiden Siegel auch noch bekommst."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Since you're heading east, can you do me a favour? Could you deliver this package to the King of the Water Region? It is a few kilometers east of here."
msgstr "Da Du eh auf dem Weg nach Osten bist, könntest Du mir einen Gefallen tun? Könntest Du dieses Paket an den König des Wasserlandes liefern? Er wohnt ein paar Kilometer östlich von hier."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Yes of course, I'll give it to him."
msgstr "Ja, natürlich. Ich werde es ihm geben."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Thank you very much. Here's to you."
msgstr "Ich danke Dir vielmals. Auf Dein Wohl."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Be careful not to drop it, it is fragile."
msgstr "Lass es nicht fallen, es ist zerbrechlich."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Sure, I'll be careful."
msgstr "Geht klar, ich werd vorsichtig sein."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Thank you again.\nI wish you a good journey, come back anytime."
msgstr "Danke nochmal.\nGute Reise und komm gern jederzeit wieder vorbei."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Good journey {{hero}}, I have faith in you."
msgstr "Gute Reise {{hero}}, ich glaube an Dich."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "As soon as I saw you I knew you would be the Last Hero."
msgstr "Als ich dich das erste Mal gesehen habe wusste ich schon dass du der letzte Held sein würdest."

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Yes, quite a lot"
msgstr "Ja, ziemlich"

#: assets/maps/story/30_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Just a little"
msgstr "Nur ein wenig"

#: assets/maps/story/15.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} found some berries! {{HP-diff}} HP have been recovered *"
msgstr "* {{hero}} hat Beeren gefunden! Es gibt {{HP-diff}} LP zurück *"

#: assets/maps/story/15.tmx:
msgid "A little plant… nothing else."
msgstr "Eine kleine Pflanze… sonst nichts."

#: assets/maps/story/33.tmx:
msgid "Hey, there are items in here!"
msgstr "Hey, dort drin sind Gegenstände!"

#: assets/maps/story/33.tmx:
msgid "There are still items in here but I've already taken one."
msgstr "Hier gibt es immer noch Gegenstände, aber ich habe bereits einen genommen."

#: assets/maps/story/33.tmx:
msgid "I can see a city in the distance."
msgstr "In der Ferne kann ich eine Stadt sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/33.tmx:
msgid "In the distance can be seen the other part of the region."
msgstr "In der Ferne ist der andere Teil der Region zu sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/33.tmx:
msgid "The inhabitants of this region leave gifts in these vases for travelers and sailors who land here.\nIt is an ancient custom.\nFeel free to take the gifts."
msgstr "In diesen Vasen hinterlassen die Einwohner dieser Region\nGeschenke für Reisende und Seeleute, die hier an Land gehen.\nZögere nicht, die Geschenke mitzunehmen."

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "VANTOI LAB – 1F"
msgstr "VANTOI-LAB – EG"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Sorry about the mess. Thieves have entered and turned everything upside down."
msgstr "Entschuldige die Unordnung. Diebe sind hier eingedrungen und haben alles durcheinander gebracht."

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "scientist"
msgstr "Wissenschaftler"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "A life's work has been destroyed…"
msgstr "Ein Lebenswerk ist zerstört worden …"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Again."
msgstr "Schon wieder."

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "{{hero}}!\nThieves broke in again 2 days ago.\nWhat's up?\nHave you decided to look for the stones?"
msgstr "{{hero}}\nVor 2 Tagen brachen wieder Diebe hier ein.\nWas ist los?\nHast du dich dazu entschieden nach den Steinen zu suchen?"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Great!"
msgstr "Hervorragend!"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Wise choice! Live your life!"
msgstr "Eine weise Entscheidung! Genieß dein Leben!"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "From my research, I think a stone is in an area close to your home."
msgstr "Durch meine Forschung bin ich davon überzeugt das ein Stein in der Gegend um dein Zuhause ist."

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "A stone may be near where you and September fought long ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Another stone might be found near the volcano."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Xeonjia Tower. I would go there to look for a stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "I think a stone is still missing but I don't know where it is.\nI've heard strange tales related to the Mitsu Forest."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Do you have all the stones?! Congratulations!\nThere is someone waiting for you in the Mitsu Forest."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "So you finished this challenge too, huh?\nBravo."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Did you organize this treasure hunt? Right?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Yes… I placed the stones…\nI did it to give you something to do."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Thank you Shen, I enjoyed it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "This makes me happy!\nBut now we're really done."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Have a nice life, {{hero}}."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Someone used this plant to do some experiments."
msgstr "Jemand hat mit dieser Pflanze einige Experimente angestellt."

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "A broken monitor."
msgstr "Ein kaputter Bildschirm."

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Ja"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab.tmx:
msgid "No"
msgstr "Nein"

#: assets/maps/story/47.tmx:
msgid "I'm sorry, but you don't have permission to use this vessel.\nIf you want to reach the Fire Region you have to take the boats that leave from the north of this region."
msgstr "Es tut mir leid, aber du bist nicht berechtigt dieses Schiff zu nutzen.\nWenn du die Feuerregion erreichen möchtest, musst du mit den Booten, die nördlich von hier ablegen, fahren."

#: assets/maps/story/8.tmx:
msgid "Go this way →"
msgstr "Gehe hier lang →"

#: assets/maps/story/69_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "There is no one here."
msgstr "Hier ist niemand."

#: assets/maps/story/76.tmx:
msgid "Oh, the sea! I missed it!"
msgstr "Oh, die See! Ich habe sie vermisst!"

#: assets/maps/story/76.tmx:
msgid "Oh, that tree is like those in the Mitsu Forest! I missed it!"
msgstr "Oh, dieser Baum ist so wie die im Mitsuwald! Ich habe sie vermisst!"

#: assets/maps/story/76.tmx:
msgid "Volcano, sea, forest.\nThere's a little bit of everything here."
msgstr "Vulkan, See, Wald.\nHier gibt's von allem etwas."

#: assets/maps/story/76.tmx:
msgid "You've traveled a long way to get here, I know that.\nI give you this."
msgstr "Du bist weit gereist um hierher zu gelangen, das weiß ich.\nIch gebe dir das hier."

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Sunfrond Town"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Oh, your hometown."
msgstr "Oh, dein Heimatort."

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Let's explore the world!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "You grew up here, right?"
msgstr "Du bist hier aufgewachsen, nicht?"

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Here is our sleepyhead!\nFinally awake!\nThe hopes of the whole Kingdom are entrusted to you and you take it easy?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "dad"
msgstr "Vater"

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "I'm a little late but what's the problem?\nThe important thing is to leave, isn't it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "No! The important thing is to come back!\nThe 63 heroes before you didn't make it, but they weren't trained by a good father like me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Do you think I'm ready?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Absolutely not!\nBut today is Departure Day, what you have learned will have to be enough for you.\nIf you don't leave today, the Kings will send next year's hero on this journey.\nIt would be humiliating for the whole family and our town."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "I know.\nNow… so… I'm leaving."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Safe travels, {{hero}}.\nIf you lose your way or get stuck take a look at the map I gave you.\nYou can open it by tapping on its icon in the upper right corner."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Okay, sure sure.\nBye!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "The tower in which the King of Evil resides should be located near the capital of the region."
msgstr "Der Turm, in dem der König des Bösen residiert, befindet sich wohl nahe der hiesigen Hauptstadt."

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Stay focused on your goals and don't wander around aimlessly."
msgstr "Konzentriere dich auf dein Ziel und irre nicht wahllos umher."

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Here is our sleepyhead hero!\nFinally awake!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Do you still have nothing to do today?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Sunfrond Town – Hometown of the 64th hero"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Sunfrond Town – Hometown of the Last Hero"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "I've to say goodbye to my parents with the \"{{inspect-key}}\" button before I leave. Otherwise it would be rude."
msgstr "Ich muss meinen Eltern noch mit der ,{{inspect-key}}‘-Taste auf Wiedersehen sagen, das wäre sonst unhöflich."

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Like my mother said, I have to go to my neighbor first."
msgstr "Wie meine Mutter schon sagte, muss ich zuerst zu meinem Nachbarn gehen."

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "From here on is the frozen floor.\nI'll slide until I reach an obstacle.\nSo I have to use my mind to figure out the best path."
msgstr "Ab hier ist der Boden gefroren.\nIch schlittere, bis ich an ein Hindernis stoße. \nAlso muss ich mir Gedanken machen, wie ich am besten weiterkomme."

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Here you are finally!\nI've been waiting for hours for you to wake up!\nHow are you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "I'm fine, even if I don't know what to do anymore.\nWhat does a hero do when there are no more villains?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "I think it's time to dedicate yourself to something else.\nBut if you really want to explore this world again, I found out that there are 5 very rare stones hidden around the Kingdom.\nEach has a particular shape and color."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Rare stones?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Yes, I have no idea what they are for.\nTo be honest, I don't even know if they're worth looking for.\nIt's just to pass the time."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Ok, maybe I'll go look for them."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Great! If so, let me know.\nNow I go, I've already wasted all morning out here waiting for you.\nCome and see me at the Vantoi Lab whenever you want.\nDo you remember where it is? Southeast of the Xeonjia Tower.\nBye!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Bye Shen!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Did you like the game? Do you want to donate to the project?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Thank you. The donation link should open soon."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1.tmx:
msgid "Thanks anyway."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t2_04.tmx:
msgid "I can't escape. I have to take the signet."
msgstr "Ich kann nicht entkommen. Ich muss das Siegel nehmen."

#: assets/maps/story/t2_04.tmx:
msgid "Here it is, this is the second signet!"
msgstr "Hier ist es, das ist das zweite Siegel!"

#: assets/maps/story/t2_04.tmx:
msgid "We can get out of here now."
msgstr "Jetzt können wir von hier weg."

#: assets/maps/story/t2_04.tmx:
msgid "The monsters are after me! I'll get the signet later."
msgstr "Diese Monster sind hinter mir her! Ich nehm' das Siegel später."

#: assets/maps/story/t2_04.tmx:
msgid "Let's get the second signet!"
msgstr "Lass uns das zweite Siegel holen!"

#: assets/maps/story/t2_04.tmx:
msgid "Hi!"
msgstr "Hallo!"

#: assets/maps/story/54.tmx:
msgid "Route 7"
msgstr "Route 7"

#: assets/maps/story/34.tmx:
msgid "Route 4"
msgstr "Route 4"

#: assets/maps/story/34.tmx:
msgid "This vase is empty."
msgstr "Diese Vase ist leer."

#: assets/maps/story/34.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} found {{money-diff}} ¤ *"
msgstr "* {{hero}} fand {{money-diff}} ¤ *"

#: assets/maps/story/34.tmx:
msgid "A rock."
msgstr "Ein Stein."

#: assets/maps/story/34.tmx:
msgid "Hexa Cave"
msgstr "Hexa-Höhle"

#: assets/maps/story/38.tmx:
msgid "Aquaville Town"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/38.tmx:
msgid "I love this village!"
msgstr "Ich liebe dieses Dorf!"

#: assets/maps/story/38.tmx:
msgid "I want to reach the capital quickly but the only way is traveling by land."
msgstr "Ich will schnell in die Hauptstadt, aber der einzige Weg führt über Land."

#: assets/maps/story/38.tmx:
msgid "I really needed a pomegranate juice."
msgstr "Ich hätte wirklich einen Granatensaft gebraucht."

#: assets/maps/story/17.tmx:
msgid "These monsters don't seem very smart to me."
msgstr "Diese Monster scheinen mir nicht sehr schlau zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/17.tmx:
msgid "I miss the monsters."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/17.tmx:
msgid "There are still enemies here. I can't escape."
msgstr "Hier sind noch immer Gegner. Ich kann nicht entkommen."

#: assets/maps/story/31_house1.tmx:
msgid "I hate people who always say the same things."
msgstr "Ich hasse Leute, die immer das gleiche sagen."

#: assets/maps/story/79_house.tmx:
msgid "Finally a hero!\nI've been waiting for years for a hero to pass by!\nMy family has been keeping this gem for decades in hopes of gifting it to a hero.\nHere's to you!"
msgstr "Endlich ein Held!\nIch warte seit Jahren, dass ein Held des Weges kommt!\nMeine Familie hat dieses Juwel in der Hoffnung es einmal einem Helden zu schenken seit Jahrzehnten aufbewahrt.\nHier für dich!"

#: assets/maps/story/79_house.tmx:
msgid "Thank you!"
msgstr "Danke!"

#: assets/maps/story/79_house.tmx:
msgid "If you defeat the King of Evil it will also be thanks to me."
msgstr "Solltest du den König des Bösen besiegen, so wird es auch mein Verdienst sein."

#: assets/maps/story/3_house2.tmx:
msgid "Hi, you look a little tired.\nHere's a bottle of water."
msgstr "Hi, Du siehst müde aus.\nHier hast Du etwas Wasser."

#: assets/maps/story/3_house2.tmx:
msgid "I wish you the best."
msgstr "Ich wünsch Dir das Beste!"

#: assets/maps/story/3_house2.tmx:
msgid "This sofa looks very comfortable."
msgstr "Dieses Sofa sieht sehr bequem aus."

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Help me please!"
msgstr "Bitte hilf mir!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr "Alles in Ordnung mit Dir?"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Yes, thank you so much for saving my life!\nI have to admit, I was so scared!"
msgstr "Ja, vielen Dank, dass Du mein Leben gerettet hast!\nIch muss zugeben, ich hatte solche Angst!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Me too!"
msgstr "Ich auch!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Luckily it went all right!\nI really don't know how to thank you…\nHere you this gem that I found a little while ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Thank you, it seems very precious!"
msgstr "Danke, er scheint sehr kostbar zu sein!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Now I think it's better for me if I go to my safe home.\nBye!"
msgstr "Ich denke, es ist nun an der Zeit, mich in mein sicheres Heim zu begeben.\nAuf Wiedersehen!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "I'll go home as soon as my legs stop shaking in fear."
msgstr "Ich werde nach Hause gehen, sobald meine Beine aufhören, vor lauter Angst zu zittern."

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Yes, I'm still here.\nI like this place."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Better if I check that the guy is okay."
msgstr "Ich schaue besser nach, ob es dem Typen gut geht."

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "! ! !"
msgstr "! ! !"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Gyaaa!"
msgstr "Ghaaa!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "monster"
msgstr "Monster"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Please help me! Save me from these monsters!"
msgstr "Bitte hilf mir! Rette mich vor diesen Monstern!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Don't worry! I'll help you right away!"
msgstr "Keine Sorge! Ich werde dir helfen!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid ". . . . ."
msgstr ". . . . ."

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid ". . . . . . . . . ."
msgstr ". . . . . . . . . ."

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "What are you waiting for??!"
msgstr "Worauf wartest du??!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "I… I… I don't know how to fight!"
msgstr "I… Ich … Ich weiß nicht wie man kämpft!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "What??\nAren't you this year's choosen hero?"
msgstr "Was??\nBist du nicht der diesjährige auserkorene Held?"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Yes, I am…"
msgstr "Ja, das bin ich…"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "But this is my first battle…"
msgstr "Aber das ist mein erster Kampf …"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "If you don't do anything this will be our LAST battle!"
msgstr "Wenn du nichts unternimmst, wird es auch unser LETZTER Kampf sein!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "We have no time left, make up something!"
msgstr "Wir haben keine Zeit mehr, überleg dir was!"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Hmm…\nAh, right! My mom gave me this book…"
msgstr "Mhm …\nAch ja! Meine Mama gab mir dieses Buch …"

#: assets/maps/story/13.tmx:
msgid "Ok, now I know what to do!\nLet's fight!"
msgstr "Okay, jetzt weiß ich was zu tun ist!\nAuf in den Kampf!"

#: assets/maps/story/73.tmx:
msgid "Hey, I found this bottle near here.\nHere's to you."
msgstr "Hey, ich habe diese Flasche in der Nähe gefunden.\nHier, für dich."

#: assets/maps/story/73.tmx:
msgid "If I find something interesting I'll give it to you."
msgstr "Wenn ich etwas Interessantes finde, werde ich es dir geben."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Route 10"
msgstr "Route 10"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "How much lavaaa!"
msgstr "So viel Lavaaa!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "It's hot here."
msgstr "Es ist heiß hier."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "How is it possible that the floor is frozen here?"
msgstr "Wie kann es sein, dass der Boden hier gefroren ist?"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Let's go to the tower!"
msgstr "Lass uns zum Turm gehen!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "!"
msgstr "!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Shen!"
msgstr "Shen!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Here you are!"
msgstr "Hier, bitte!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Hi Shen!"
msgstr "Hallo Shen!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Did you take the third signet?"
msgstr "Hast du das dritte Siegel genommen?"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "No, it wasn't in the crypt!\nSomeone must have taken it before us."
msgstr "Nein, es war nicht in der Krypta!\nJemand muss es zuvor genommem haben."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "What?!\nHmm… Very strange… I think I know who did it…\nSeptember."
msgstr "Was?!\nHmm… Sehr seltsam… Ich glaube ich weiß, wer das war…\nSeptember."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "September!?"
msgstr "September!?"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Well, yes, you know how she is.\nShe must have gone there to get the signet by herself and now she's probablu going to the tower."
msgstr "Nun, ja, du weißt wie sie ist.\nSie muss wohl dort hingegangen sein um das dritte Siegel zu holen und nun wird sie wohl auf dem Weg zum Turm sein."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "At this point let's hope that's how it went.\nAt least with that signet plus my 2 signets we can enter."
msgstr "Hoffen wir vorerst, dass es tatsächlich so ist.\nZumindest können wir mit diesem und meinen zwei Siegeln eintreten."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Before going to the tower we need the help of the Spirit of the Fire.\nThe inside of the Xeonjia Tower is too cold for us, we have to increase its temperature. Otherwise we freeze."
msgstr "Bevor wir zum Turm gehen, müssen wir dem Feuergeist helfen.\nIm Xeonjia-Turm ist es zu kalt für uns, also müssen wir die Temperatur erhöhen. Sonst erfrieren wir."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Ah right, the King of Evil needs very low temperatures to live."
msgstr "Ah stimmt, der König des Bösen braucht äußerst tiefe Temperaturen zum Überleben."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "The problem is that I don't know how to summon the spirit.\nFrom my studies I think we have to do it from here."
msgstr "Das Problem ist, dass ich nicht weiß wie man den Geist beschwören kann.\nLaut meinen Studien, denke ich, müssen wir es von hier aus machen."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "I can do it!"
msgstr "Ich kann das schaffen!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "You?"
msgstr "Du?"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Yes!"
msgstr "Ja!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Spirit of Fire! Spirit of Fire! We need you!"
msgstr "Feuergeist! Oh, Feuergeist! Wir brauchen dich!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Here I am!"
msgstr "Ich bin da!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Milla! You need me?"
msgstr "Milla! Brauchst du mich?"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "They. They need you."
msgstr "Sie. Sie brauchen dich."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Do you know each other?"
msgstr "Kennen wir einander?"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Yes, but we don't get along very well."
msgstr "Ja, aber wir kommen nicht gut miteinander aus."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "It's not true, Milla always exaggerates.\nWe are \"best friends forever\"."
msgstr "Das stimmt nicht, Milla übertreibt immer.\nWir sind \"für immer beste Freunde\"."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "You always tease me. You know I hate fire."
msgstr "Du triezst mich immer. Du weißt, dass ich Feuer hasse."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Fire is your friend if you are its friend."
msgstr "Feuer ist dein Freund, wenn du des Feuers Freund bist."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "I prefer the Spirit of Water, at least he makes me feel good."
msgstr "Ich ziehe den Wassergeist vor, immerhin macht er, dass ich mich gut fühle."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Don't tell me about the Spirit of Water!\nIt's unbearable!"
msgstr "Hör auf mit dem Wassergeist!\nDas ist nicht zum Aushalten!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Can anyone tell me what's going on?!"
msgstr "Kann mir einer sagen, was hier los ist?!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Milla is the Spirit of the Forest."
msgstr "Milla ist der Waldgeist."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "What?!\nAnd why didn't you tell me sooner?!"
msgstr "Was?!\nWarum hast du mir das nicht früher gesagt?!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Last time you were in a hurry, there was no opportunity."
msgstr "Letztes mal warst du in Eile, da war keine Gelegenheit."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "There is always an opportunity to say something like this!"
msgstr "Es gibt immer eine Gelegenheit soetwas zu sagen!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "I've been hearing that a lot lately."
msgstr "Das höre ich in letzter Zeit öfters."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Don't worry Shen. I, too, recently found it out."
msgstr "Keine Sorge, Shen. Auch ich habe es kürzlich herausgefunden."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "We'll talk about it later…"
msgstr "Wir reden später darüber…"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Spirit of Fire, can you help us by heating the Xeonjia Tower?\nIt must reach a comfortable temperature for humans."
msgstr "Feuergeist, kannst du uns helfen indem du den Xeonjia-Turm erwärmst?\nEr muss für Menschen geeignete Temperaturen erreichen."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Of course! I love heating things!"
msgstr "Sicher! Ich liebe es, Dinge zu heizen!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Great!\nIt was easy.\nThank you very much!"
msgstr "Großartig!\nDas war leicht.\nDanke dir vielmals!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Milla?"
msgstr "Milla?"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Thank you…"
msgstr "Danke…"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "I know you love me Milla.\nAfter you defeat the King of Evil let's go on vacation together."
msgstr "Ich weiß, du liebst mich, Milla.\nNachdem du den König des Bösen besiegt haben wirst, lass uns gemeinsam auf Urlaub gehen."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "We'll see…"
msgstr "Wir werden sehen…"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "I force you."
msgstr "Ich zwinge dich."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "I'm leaving you now, I'm getting ready to warm up the tower, it will require a lot of energy.\nBye!"
msgstr "Ich gehe jetzt. Ich bereite mich vor, den Turm aufzuwärmen - das wird viel Energie benötigen.\nBaba!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Bye!"
msgstr "Tschüss!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Great.\nNow only the third signet is missing which I hope September has.\nLet's meet at Xeonjia Tower."
msgstr "Großartig.\nNun fehlt nur mehr das dritte Siegel, welches hoffentlich September hat.\nLass uns einander beim Xeonjia-Turm treffen."

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "Ok see you soon!"
msgstr "Ok, wir sehen einander bald!"

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "There is lava here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/75.tmx:
msgid "fire spirit"
msgstr "Feuergeist"

#: assets/maps/story/68.tmx:
msgid "How many meters above sea level are we?"
msgstr "Auf wie vielen Metern über dem Meeresspiegel befinden wir uns?"

#: assets/maps/story/70_house4.tmx:
msgid "The Fire Region is the smallest region of the Kingdom, but that doesn't make it the least important."
msgstr "Die Feuerregion ist die kleinste Region im Königreich, das macht sie jedoch um nichts weniger bedeutsam."

#: assets/maps/story/70_house4.tmx:
msgid "There is a book called \"Your child, the Hero! – Prepare your child to become a Hero in 10 steps\".\nDo you want to read it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house4.tmx:
msgid "Greetings, brave and ambitious parents!\nSure, there's no greater desire than to see one's child selected as the future Hero, right?\nOur very young children, at the age of 5, are subjected to tests of intelligence, audacity and strength.\nOnly ONE child is chosen each year, destined to become the Hero who will embark on the epic adventure on November 24 of the year of their 21st birthday.\nNow, you may be wondering: \"How can I make sure that my child is the chosen one?\". Well, the answer is simpler than you might imagine! And you've already done the first step: you bought this book!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house4.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} stops reading *"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/57_house.tmx:
msgid "Are you the 64th hero?\nIt's been a while since a hero has been around here, they almost always give up before arriving here."
msgstr "Bist du der 64. Held?\nEs ist schon ein Zeitchen her seit ein Held hier vorbeigekommen ist - sie geben fast immer vorher auf."

#: assets/maps/story/57_house.tmx:
msgid "I tell all my friends that I met you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "The prices for an HP UP are too high for me."
msgstr "Diese LP-UPs sind mir zu teuer."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I would love to leave for a long journey but I don't have the strength anymore."
msgstr "Ich würde gern auf eine lange Reise gehen, aber dafür bin ich mittlerweile einfach zu schwach."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "{{hero}}, there you are. Finally! I heard a rumor that you were coming here."
msgstr "{{hero}}, endlich bist du hier. Wir hatten Gerüchte darüber gehört, dass du herkommen würdest."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "September! Long time no see! Last time was when we battled each other to be proclaimed HERO.\nWe were 5 years old."
msgstr "September! Wir haben uns ja ewig nicht gesehen! Das letzte Mal haben wir uns gerauft, wer als HELD auserkoren werden soll.\nDa waren wir 5 Jahre alt."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I remember well, you got lucky that time.\nBut now it would go differently.\nI challenge you now. Show me that you are better than me.\nSee you on the north-east side of the village.\nI will wait for you there."
msgstr "Ich weiß, du hattest Glück damals..\nHeute würde es jedoch anders laufen.\nIch fordere dich heraus. Zeig mir, dass du besser bist als ich.\nKomm in den Nordosten des Dorfes.\nIch werde dort auf dich warten."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "W-wait a moment, September!"
msgstr "W-Warte mal, September!"

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "How are you? Everything good? I haven't seen you for 16 years… We have so much to talk about."
msgstr "Wie geht's dir? Alles gut? Ich habe dich seit 16 Jahren nicht gesehen … Wir haben soviel zu besprechen."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I don't have time to mess around.\nSee you where I told you."
msgstr "Ich hab keine Zeit zu verlieren.\nWir treffen uns am abgemachten Ort."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "Ok… see you later."
msgstr "Okay … bis später."

#: assets/maps/story/37.tmx:
msgid "I remembered her less surly."
msgstr "Ich hatte sie weniger bedrohlich in Erinnerung."

#: assets/maps/story/77.tmx:
msgid "Route 11"
msgstr "Route 11"

#: assets/maps/story/77.tmx:
msgid "Cableway"
msgstr "Seilbahn"

#: assets/maps/story/77.tmx:
msgid "I can see the inside of the building."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/14.tmx:
msgid "Hello, I'm a workers of the Kingdom.\nI'm smoothing this rock so it doesn't hurt anymore.\nA lot of people complain about these rocks, I'm sorry."
msgstr "Hallo ich bin ein Arbeiter des Königreichs.\nIch glätte diesen Stein, damit sich niemand mehr daran verletzt.\nViele Leute haben sich schon über diese Steine beschwert. Tut mir leid."

#: assets/maps/story/14.tmx:
msgid "Maybe one day these rocks will all be nice and smooth, but today is not that day."
msgstr "Vielleicht werden eines Tages alle diese Steine schön glatt sein. Aber dieser Tag ist noch fern."

#: assets/maps/story/14.tmx:
msgid "← Pharmacy"
msgstr "← Apotheke"

#: assets/maps/story/14.tmx:
msgid "I guess this rock has just been smoothed out."
msgstr "Dieser Stein wurde vermutlich erst kürzlich geglättet."

#: assets/maps/story/18.tmx:
msgid "I have to stay here because if I move you can't get out anymore."
msgstr "Ich muss hierbleiben, denn wenn ich mich auch nur ein kleines Stück bewege, kommst du hier nie mehr raus."

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "We stop for a picnic? No?"
msgstr "Wir machen für ein Picknick halt? Nein?"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Oops… yes, sorry, I am in the middle of the road…\nAre you a tourist? There are very few nowadays."
msgstr "Oh, ja, tut mir leid. Ich bin mitten auf der Straße …\nBist Du Tourist? Davon gibt es heutzutage nur sehr wenige."

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "???"
msgstr "???"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "N-no, I'm {{hero}}, this year's chosen hero."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "What?! So is it you?!"
msgstr "Was?! Du bist das?!"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Nice to meet you, I've never met a hero before."
msgstr "Schön, Dich kennenzulernen, ich habe noch nie einen Helden getroffen."

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "My name is Milla, I was born and raised in this area.\nWhy are you here?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "I just left home to try to defeat the King of Evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "I too am setting out on a journey!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Oh cool! Where are you going?"
msgstr "Oh, cool! Wohin geht's?"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "I have absolutely no idea."
msgstr "Ich habe nicht die geringste Ahnung."

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "I just want to explore the world, know new places and learn new things!\nIt won't be easy but I want to visit the whole Kingdom!\nAnd maybe even visit places outside the Kingdom!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Are there places outside the Kingdom?!"
msgstr "Gibt es Orte außerhalb des Königreichs?!"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Dunno, that's what I want to find out!"
msgstr "Keine Ahnung, das möchte ich herausfinden!"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Anyway…\nI was wondering… Do you… Do you want to stop for a picnic?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Oh, I'm sorry but I want to reach the Xeonjia Tower as soon as possible."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Hopefully before dark."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Oh well yeah sure."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Maybe after defeating the King of Evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Sure!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Anyway, I don't want to waste any more of your time."
msgstr "Egal, ich möchte Dir nicht mehr von Deiner Zeit stehlen."

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "After all, you have to save the world. Not an easy task!"
msgstr "Schließlich musst Du die Welt retten, das ist keine leichte Aufgabe!"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "I'm sure we'll meet again soon, hero."
msgstr "Ich bin sicher, dass wir uns bald wiedersehen werden, Held."

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "See ya!"
msgstr "Bis dann!"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Bye Milla!"
msgstr "Auf Wiedersehen, Milla!"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Picnic area – Do not leave rubbish, thanks."
msgstr "Picknick-Platz – Bitte sauber halten, danke."

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Picnic area ↑"
msgstr "Picknick-Platz ↑"

#: assets/maps/story/7.tmx:
msgid "Forest Center ↓"
msgstr "Waldzentrum ↓"

#: assets/maps/story/28_lp_shop.tmx:
msgid "Pharmacy"
msgstr "Apotheke"

#: assets/maps/story/28_lp_shop.tmx:
msgid "Welcome to my shop!"
msgstr "Willkommen in meinem Laden!"

#: assets/maps/story/28_lp_shop.tmx:
msgid "pharmacist"
msgstr "Apotheker"

#: assets/maps/story/28_lp_shop.tmx:
msgid "I wanted to buy some medicines but they don't have the ones I like."
msgstr "Ich wollte etwas Medizin kaufen, aber sie hatten nicht die richtige."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I'm green if #5 and #6 are both the same color. Otherwise I'm red."
msgstr "Ich bin grün, wenn Nr. 5 und Nr. 6 beide die selbe Farbe haben. Sonst bin ich rot."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "rock #3"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "There is a button, do I press it?"
msgstr "Da ist ein Knopf, soll ich ihn drücken?"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I no longer need to press the button."
msgstr "Ich brauche den Knopf nicht mehr zu drücken."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I'm red if #1 is red. Otherwise I'm green."
msgstr "Ich bin rot, wenn Nr. 1 rot ist. Sonst bin ich grün."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "rock #5"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I'm green if #3 is green. Otherwise I'm red."
msgstr "Ich bin grün, wenn Nr. 3 grün ist. Sonst bin ich rot."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "rock #4"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I'm green if #4 is red. Otherwise I'm red."
msgstr "Ich bin grün, wenn Nr. 4 rot ist. Sonst bin ich rot."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "rock #2"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I'm red if #4 is green. Otherwise I'm green."
msgstr "Ich bin rot, wenn Nr. 4 grün ist. Sonst bin ich grün."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "rock #1"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I'm red if #2 is green. Otherwise I'm green."
msgstr "Ich bin rot, wenn Nr. 2 grün ist. Sonst bin ich grün."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "rock #6"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Hi {{hero}}! How are you doing? Were you able to get the first signet?"
msgstr "Hallo {{hero}}! Wie geht's? Hast Du das erste Siegel bekommen?"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Hi Shen! Yes I did it!"
msgstr "Hallo Schenn! Ja, ich habe's geschafft!"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "But it was not easy."
msgstr "Es war allerdings nicht einfach."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I didn't have any big problems."
msgstr "War kein Problem."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Great! I had no doubt you would make it.\nDid you find the snowballs helpful?"
msgstr "Großartig! Ich hatte keine Zweifel, dass Du es schaffen würdest.\nWaren die Schneebälle hilfreich?"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Yes, I couldn't do it without them, thank you!\nWhat is this place?"
msgstr "Ja, ohne sie wäre ich wirklich in Schwierigkeiten gewesen, danke nochmal!\nWas ist das hier für ein Ort?"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I think it is an ancient cave.\nLook at this inscription."
msgstr "Ich denke, das hier ist eine antike Höhle.\nSchau Dir mal die Inschrift an."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Everything originated from water, everything will return to water."
msgstr "Alles kam aus dem Wasser, alles wird ins Wasser zurückkehren."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "What does it say? What does it mean?"
msgstr "Was steht denn da? Was soll das heißen?"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "It is the ancient writing used in these areas long ago.\nHere it says:"
msgstr "Das ist die antike Schrift, die man hier vor langer Zeit verwendet hat.\nHier steht:"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I think somehow it's possible to invoke the protective spirit of this region. We just have to figure out how."
msgstr "Ich glaube, wir können irgendwie den Schutzgeist dieser Region erwecken. Wir müssen bloß herausfinden, wie."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "!!!"
msgstr "!!!"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Slooosh!"
msgstr "Wuuusch!"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Hi, I'm the Spirit of Water.\nIs there anything you need?\nI don't have much time, with this cold I quickly become ice. And I'd say there's enough ice here."
msgstr "Hallo, ich bin der Geist des Wassers.\nKann ich irgendetwas für euch tun?\nIch habe nicht viel Zeit; in dieser Kälte laufe ich Gefahr, zu gefrieren.\nUnd ich denke, hier gibt es bereits genügend Eis."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "water spirit"
msgstr "Geist des Wassers"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "{{hero}} what could we ask him? I have plenty of questions, but if you agree I would ask him if he knows anything about the King of Evil."
msgstr "{{hero}}, was könnten wir ihn fragen? Mir fällt so Einiges ein, allerdings sollten wir ihn wohl zuerst nach dem König des Bösen befragen."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I agree! I have to defeat him but I don't even know why he's here or what his purpose is."
msgstr "Du hast Recht! Ich muss ihn erledigen, aber ich weiß nicht einmal, warum er eigentlich hier ist."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "The King of Evil, as you know, came to us 65 years ago freezing the Kingdom and instilling fear.\nI don't know exactly where he comes from, but what I do know is that his goal is to collect gems that are scattered around the world.\nHe needs them to get energy to completely freeze our world."
msgstr "Wie Du weißt, kam der König des Bösen vor 65 Jahren, fror das Königreich ein und verbreitet seitdem Angst und Schrecken.\nIch weiß nicht genau, wo er herkommt, aber ich weiß, dass es sein Ziel ist, Edelsteine einzusammeln, die über die Welt verteilt sind.\nEr braucht deren Energie, um die ganze Welt einzufrieren."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Completely?!"
msgstr "Die ganze Welt?!"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Yes, we are lucky we still have seas and a bearable temperature, but if he succeeds in his plan the Kingdom will no longer be livable for us."
msgstr "Allerdings. Wir können froh sein, überhaupt noch Meere und eine erträgliche Temperatur zu haben, aber wenn er seinen Plan verwirklicht, ist es aus mit uns."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "And why would he want that??"
msgstr "Und warum sollte er das tun??"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Because he and his fellows need very low temperatures to live, temperatures so low that right now there are only in the Xeonjia Tower."
msgstr "Nun, er und seine Leute brauchen ein sehr kaltes Klima, um überleben zu können. So kalt ist es aktuell nur im Turm von Xeonjia."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "So he's making our Kingdom unlivable for us to make it livable for him?!"
msgstr "Also will er das Königreich für sich, ohne dabei Rücksicht auf uns zu nehmen?!"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Exactly.\nThe only way to stop him is to find as many gems as possible and finally defeat him, of course.\nHe uses the Hoarfrost Team to search for gems because he cannot leave the tower.\nThis is what I know about the King of Evil. Now I must leave you to avoid becoming an ice pop, but we will see each other again in the future.\nI will appear to you when you need me."
msgstr "Richtig.\nDer einzige Weg, ihn aufzuhalten, ist, soviele Kristalle wie möglich zu finden und ihn zu überwältigen.\nEr lässt sich von Team Raureif helfen, weil er den Turm nicht verlassen kann.\nDas ist alles, was ich über ihn weiß. Ich muss mich verabschieden, bevor ich zu Eis werde. Wir werden uns wiedersehen.\nIch werde Dir erscheinen, wenn Du mich brauchst."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "So gems are more important than I thought… And they can be used as an energy source.\nI only have one, how many have you found so far?"
msgstr "Also sind die Kristalle wichtiger, als ich dachte … Und sie können als Energiequelle genutzt werden.\nIch habe erst einen, wie viele hast Du auftreiben können?"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I only have one too, a guy I rescued in the Mitsu Forest gave it to me."
msgstr "Ich habe auch nur einen, ein Typ, dem ich im Mitsuwald geholfen habe, hat ihn mir gegeben."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Not quite enough."
msgstr "Das reicht nicht ganz."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I have found {{gem_count}} so far."
msgstr "Ich habe bis jetzt {{gem_count}} Stück."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Well, it's a start."
msgstr "Das ist schonmal ein Anfang."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "We need to be more careful and look for them better.\nNow I'll leave you and continue my studies on the gem I have.\nSee you!"
msgstr "Wir müssen vorsichtig sein und gezielter nach den Kristallen Ausschau halten.\nIch gehe den Kristall, den ich gefunden habe, untersuchen.\nBis dann!"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Bye Shen, be careful!"
msgstr "Tschüs Schenn, pass auf dich auf!"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Let me know if you need help."
msgstr "Komm zu mir, falls du Hilfe brauchst."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I think that all the writings on the six rocks must be true to invoke the spirit."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I think that #1 should be green."
msgstr "Ich denke, Nr. 1 sollte grün sein."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "Do you need help?"
msgstr "Brauchst du Hilfe?"

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "It doesn't seem difficult to solve."
msgstr "Es scheint mir leicht lösbar zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/34_cave.tmx:
msgid "I don't know what you did but it seems to have worked."
msgstr "Ich hab zwar keine Ahnung, was du gemacht hast, aber es scheint funktioniert zu haben."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_04.tmx:
msgid "MOSSY CRYPT – B4F"
msgstr "Moosbewachsene Krypta – 4. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_02.tmx:
msgid "MOSSY CRYPT – B2F"
msgstr "Moosbewachsene Krypta – 2. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_02.tmx:
msgid "We're watching you."
msgstr "Wir beobachten Dich."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_02.tmx:
msgid "The snowballs container is full."
msgstr "Der Behälter für Schneebälle ist voll."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_02.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} fills his snowballs container *"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t1_02.tmx:
msgid "A snowdrift."
msgstr "Eine Schneewehe."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_02.tmx:
msgid "Hmm, I think if I run out of snowballs I can make new ones from snowdrifts like this one.\nI just have to press the \"{{inspect-key}}\" button."
msgstr "Hmm, ich denke, wenn ich keine Schneebälle mehr habe, kann ich an Schneeverwehungen wie dieser neue machen.\nIch muss nur die \"{{inspect-key}}\"-Taste drücken."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_02.tmx:
msgid "A rock covered by moss."
msgstr "Ein moosbewachsener Stein."

#: assets/maps/story/70_house2.tmx:
msgid "Did you know that dragons sleep inside volcanoes?\nI've never seen one but I believe it."
msgstr "Wusstest du, dass Drachen im Inneren des Vulkans schlafen?\nIch hab' noch nie einen gesehen, aber ich glaub's."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "Today… today… today is a day like many others.\nSince the King of Evil was defeated 1 month ago, I don't have much to do."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "Today… today is the day I've been waiting for all my life. My journey to the Xeonjia Tower is about to begin.\nThis year I'm the \"chosen hero\" in charge of defeating the monster that froze the Kingdom…\nAfter years of training I hope to be able to."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "I wish I knew you when you were little."
msgstr "Ich wünschte, ich hätte dich gekannt als du klein warst."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "What do we do today?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "It all started here."
msgstr "Hier hat alles begonnen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "I'd like to go back to bed but I can't."
msgstr "Ich will zurück ins Bett, aber ich kann nicht."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "It has been quite a while since the last time I slept here."
msgstr "Es ist schon eine ganze Weile her, seit ich das letzte Mal hier übernachtet habe."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "I've already been in bed too long in the past few weeks…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "I'll miss you, TV."
msgstr "I werde dich vermissen, Fernseher."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "I don't want to watch television now."
msgstr "Ich möchte gerade nicht fernsehen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "Too much TV lately."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "There's a bit of dust back here."
msgstr "Hier hinten ist es ein wenig staubig."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "I can't use the TV from this side."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "I hope my parents will water it when I'm away."
msgstr "Ich hoffe, meine Eltern werden sie gießen, während ich fort bin."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "This plant hasn't been watered for long."
msgstr "Diese Pflanze wurde ewig nicht mehr gegossen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "This plant is very fragrant."
msgstr "Diese Pflanze duftet gut."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "All my books are here."
msgstr "Hier sind all meine Bücher verstaut."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "My chair."
msgstr "Mein Stuhl."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home_2.tmx:
msgid "From here I can see the garden."
msgstr "Von hier kann ich den Garten sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/24.tmx:
msgid "Greentwig City"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24.tmx:
msgid "The city center is a few kilometers to the south."
msgstr "Das Stadtzentrum befindet sich einige Kilometer südlich."

#: assets/maps/story/24.tmx:
msgid "Vantoi Lab – The most prestigious Science Lab in the Kingdom!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24.tmx:
msgid "I can see the inside of the Laboratory."
msgstr "Ich kann das Innere des Labors sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/24.tmx:
msgid "I can see the inside of the Pharmacy."
msgstr "Ich kann das Innere der Apotheke sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/24.tmx:
msgid "Greentwig City – Regional capital"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24.tmx:
msgid "I can see the inside of the house."
msgstr "Ich kann das Innere des Hauses sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/53_house4.tmx:
msgid "I too would like to stay there, but nobody ever invites me."
msgstr "Auch ich würde gerne hier bleiben, aber niemand hat mich je eingeladen."

#: assets/maps/story/53_house4.tmx:
msgid "This door is closed."
msgstr "Diese Tür ist verschlossen."

#: assets/maps/story/26.tmx:
msgid "Did you come here just to talk to me?\nI don't have much to say, but I can give you this little snow globe."
msgstr "Bist du hier hergekommen, nur um mit mir zu reden?\nIch habe nicht viel zu sagen, aber ich kann dir diese kleine Schneekugel geben."

#: assets/maps/story/26.tmx:
msgid "The weather is good today."
msgstr "Heute ist gutes Wetter."

#: assets/maps/story/26.tmx:
msgid "We keep an eye on you."
msgstr "Wir werden Dich beobachten."

#: assets/maps/story/26.tmx:
msgid "Ah, the Hoarfrost Team was defeated?\nNobody told me.\nAnd now what do I do?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/69_house3.tmx:
msgid "The air here is filled with the smells of sulfur and smoke, but you get used to it and it becomes a part of everyday life."
msgstr "Hier liegt der Geruch von Schwefel und Rauch in der Luft. Man gewöhnt sich daran und es wird ein Teil deines Alltags."

#: assets/maps/story/69_house3.tmx:
msgid "You have traveled a long way, keep some water."
msgstr "Du hast eine lange Reise hinter dir, behalte etwas Wasser."

#: assets/maps/story/69_house3.tmx:
msgid "Getting enough water is important for your health."
msgstr "Ausreichend Wasser zu trinken ist wichtig für die Gesundheit."

#: assets/maps/story/41_house.tmx:
msgid "These books are in a language I don't understand."
msgstr "Diese Bücher sind in einer Sprache geschrieben, die ich nicht verstehe."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Route 3"
msgstr "Route 3"

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Hey! Hi {{hero}}!"
msgstr "Hey! Hi {{hero}}!"

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "H-hi, you know me?"
msgstr "H-hallo, Du kennst mich?"

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Well, you are the hero of this year, you are quite famous. Are you here to visit the crypt?"
msgstr "Nun, Du bist der Held des Jahres und ziemlich berühmt. Bist Du hier, um die Krypta zu besuchen?"

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Yes!\nHere's one of the 3 signets I need to access the Xeonjia Tower."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Ah that's true, I've heard of it.\nBeware that here is full of monsters and bad people."
msgstr "Ah, das stimmt, ich habe davon gehört.\nSieh Dich vor, hier ist alles voller Monster und schlechter Menschen."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Ok thanks, I'll be careful.\nBut… who are you?"
msgstr "Danke, ich werde vorsichtig sein.\nAber...wer bist Du?"

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Oh, yes sorry I forgot to introduce myself."
msgstr "Oh, Verzeihung, ich vergaß, mich vorzustellen."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "My name is Shen, I am a scientist."
msgstr "Mein Name ist Schenn. Ich bin Wissenschaftlerin."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Nice to meet you, Shen."
msgstr "Schön, Dich kennenzulernen, Schenn."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Oh, by the way, I think this might help you."
msgstr "Übrigens, ich glaube das könnte Dir helfen."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "* Shen gives a SNOWBALLS CONTAINER to {{hero}} *"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "It's an invention of mine.\nWith this you can throw snowballs at your opponents by pressing the \"{{snowball-key}}\" button.\nIt can contain up to 5 snowballs."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Wow! I'm sure it'll come in handy. Thank you."
msgstr "Wow! Das wird sicher nützlich sein. Dankeschön."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "Gern geschehen."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Unfortunately some time ago all the project blueprints were stolen and so the Hoarfrost Team has it too."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Well, at least it will be an equal fight."
msgstr "Na, zumindest wird es ein ebenbürtiger Kampf."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Haha, well, you're right."
msgstr "Haha, da hast du Recht."

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Now I have to leave you, I have to study a strange gem that I found a little while ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "We'll see again. Good luck!"
msgstr "Wir sehen uns wieder. Viel Glück!"

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "Bye Shen, thanks again!"
msgstr "Mach's gut, Schenn, und nochmals vielen Dank!"

#: assets/maps/story/22.tmx:
msgid "I have to go through the crypt to get the first signet."
msgstr "Ich muss durch die Krypta gehen, um das erste Siegel zu bekommen."

#: assets/maps/story/x5.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 5F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x5.tmx:
msgid "They could have put an elevator."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x5.tmx:
msgid "How many floors do you think there are?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x5.tmx:
msgid "I can't use the HP machine from this side."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/69_house1.tmx:
msgid "The volcano is the heart and soul of our community.\nEverything we do is influenced by his mood."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/69_house1.tmx:
msgid "I was a main character in the story but due to lack of time and budget I was cut off.\nBut I swear I'm important, eh."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/69_house1.tmx:
msgid "someone"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/51.tmx:
msgid "I got old before I learned how to be young."
msgstr "Ich bin alt geworden bevor ich gelernt habe jung zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/9.tmx:
msgid "This is not a place for kids, go home."
msgstr "Das ist kein Ort für Kinder, geh nach Hause."

#: assets/maps/story/9.tmx:
msgid "How rude!\nHe pushed me away viciously!"
msgstr "Wie ungehobelt!\nEr hat mich brutal weggeschubst!"

#: assets/maps/story/9.tmx:
msgid "Weird things happen in this area…"
msgstr "In dieser Gegend passieren merkwürdige Dinge …"

#: assets/maps/story/9.tmx:
msgid "If you get lost, follow the road signs."
msgstr "Falls Du Dich verläufst, folge einfach den Straßenschildern."

#: assets/maps/story/9.tmx:
msgid "Tetrahedron, fire.\nHexahedron, earth.\nOctahedron, air.\nIcosahedron, water.\nDodecahedron, universe.\nYou dwell in them all, and they all dwell in you.\nYou have now completed the game.\nThe only thing I can tell you now is:\nThank you.\nXeonjia will live in you forever."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/19.tmx:
msgid "You must be thirsty, here's this bottle of water for you."
msgstr "Du musst durstig sein, hier ist eine Flasche Wasser für dich."

#: assets/maps/story/19.tmx:
msgid "Good luck."
msgstr "Viel Glück."

#: assets/maps/story/19.tmx:
msgid "Xeonjia Tower ↑"
msgstr "Xeonjia-Turm ↑"

#: assets/maps/story/19.tmx:
msgid "Tourist Information and Reception Office.\nClosed until further notice."
msgstr "Touristeninformation und Empfangsbüro.\nBis auf weiteres geschlossen."

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "Mitsu Forest"
msgstr "Mitsuwald"

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "Nobody knows what the writing on this rock means, it is not even known who wrote it."
msgstr "Niemand weiß, was die Schrift auf diesem Stein bedeutet. Es ist nicht einmal bekannt, wer sie geschrieben hat."

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "Do you want to hear the legend of this tree again?"
msgstr "Möchtest Du die Legende dieses Baumes noch einmal hören?"

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "Are you interested to learn about the legend of this tree?"
msgstr "Möchtest Du mehr über die Legende dieses Baumes erfahren?"

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "A looong time ago, way before the arrival of the King of Evil, there was a devastating war in this area.\nEverything was razed to the ground.\nNothing and no one remained, except this tree.\nIt is said that this tree encloses all the souls who left us.\nIt has the peculiarity of losing its leaves in spring and blooming in the other seasons.\nEvery spring the souls leave this tree to make other plants bloom and then, at the end of spring, the souls return to flourish again this tree.\nThat's all I know about this tree.\nI hope to live long enough to see the end of this winter season which has persisted for more than 60 years now."
msgstr "Vor laaanger Zeit, lange vor der Ankunft des Königs des Bösen gab es einen verheerenden Krieg in diesem Gebiet.\nAlles wurde dem Erdboden gleich gemacht.\nNichts und niemand ist geblieben, außer diesem Baum.\nEs wird erzählt, dass dieser Baum all die Seelen derer beinhaltet, die uns verlassen haben.\nEr hat die Eigenart, seine Blätter im Frühling zu verlieren und in den anderen Jahreszeiten zu blühen.\nJeden Frühling verlassen die Seelen den Baum, um andere Pflanzen zum Blühen zu bringen, und dann, am Ende des Frühlings, kommen die Seelen wieder zurück, um diesen Baum gedeihen zu lassen.\nDas ist alles was ich über diesen Baum weiß.\nIch hoffe, lang genug zu leben, um das Ende dieses Winters zu sehen, welcher nun schon mehr als 60 Jahre anhält."

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "Ok, it was a long and boring story after all."
msgstr "Das war eine echt lange und öde Geschichte."

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "Yes please"
msgstr "Ja, bitte"

#: assets/maps/story/29.tmx:
msgid "No thanks"
msgstr "Nein, danke"

#: assets/maps/story/t3_01.tmx:
msgid "FIERY CRYPT – B1F"
msgstr "Feuerkrypta – 1. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/24_house1.tmx:
msgid "The computer appears to be broken."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_house1.tmx:
msgid "!\nAn object has materialized here!\nIt's a stone."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/24_house1.tmx:
msgid "A computer turned off. Looks like a key is needed to turn it on."
msgstr "Ein ausgeschalteter Computer. Es scheint, als wäre ein Schlüssel erforderlich, um ihn einzuschalten."

#: assets/maps/story/24_house1.tmx:
msgid "There's nothing back here."
msgstr "Hier hinten befindet sich absolut nichts."

#: assets/maps/story/55_cableway.tmx:
msgid "Do you want to go back down the volcano?"
msgstr "Möchtest du in den Vulkan zurückkehren?"

#: assets/maps/story/55_cableway.tmx:
msgid "I'm scared, I'm scared! What if there is a fault?! What if I get stuck?! If I can't get off anymore?! I suffer from claustrophobia.\nDrinking water helps, maybe.\nYou don't seem comfortable either, here's to you."
msgstr "Ich hab Angst, ich hab Angst! Was wenn etwas nicht richtig funktioniert?! Was wenn wir stecken bleiben?! Wenn ich nicht mehr raus kann?! Ich hab Klaustrophobie.\nWassertrinken hilft vielleicht.\nDu schaust auch nicht entspannt aus. Auf dich."

#: assets/maps/story/55_cableway.tmx:
msgid "On the next ride I really get on it."
msgstr "Bei der nächsten Fahrt, steige ich wirklich ein."

#: assets/maps/story/55_cableway.tmx:
msgid "My journey is almost over, I'm a little bit sad for this."
msgstr "Meine Reise neigt sich dem Ende zu, ich bin ein bisschen traurig."

#: assets/maps/story/21.tmx:
msgid "Route 2"
msgstr "Route 2"

#: assets/maps/story/21.tmx:
msgid "Greentwig City →"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "Hi, I'm sorry but we're closed. Once this was a busy shop, but now it doesn't even make sense to stay open."
msgstr "Hallo, es tut mir leid, aber wir haben geschlossen. Früher war der Laden gut besucht, aber jetzt lohnt es sich nicht mehr, ihn zu öffnen."

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "shopkeeper"
msgstr "Geschäftsinhaber"

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "It's full of old junk here."
msgstr "Hier ist alles voll mit altem Schrott."

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "I've never seen so much dust."
msgstr "Ich hab noch nie so viel Staub gesehen."

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "Here it's full of snow globes with a miniaturized Mitsu Forest inside. When they were built, snow was a very rare phenomenon here and it was much more appreciated."
msgstr "Hier sind überall Schneekugeln mit einer Miniatur des Mitsuwaldes darin. Als sie hergestellt wurden, war Schnee hier ein sehr seltenes Phänomen und man schätzte ihn viel mehr."

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "There are very expensive junk here."
msgstr "Hier gibt es sehr teuren Ramsch."

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "I think this vase was placed here on purpose to block the passage."
msgstr "Ich glaube, diese Vase wurde absichtlich hier platziert, um den Durchgang zu versperren."

#: assets/maps/story/10_old_shop.tmx:
msgid "From this window I can only see a tree."
msgstr "Durch dieses Fenster kann ich nur einen Baum erkennen."

#: assets/maps/story/t2_03.tmx:
msgid "WATERY CRYPT – B3F"
msgstr "WASSERKRYPTA – 3. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t2_03.tmx:
msgid "We won! We are strong!\nLet's move on."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_2.tmx:
msgid "How is it possible that there is all this built under the bridge?"
msgstr "Wie kann es sein, dass all das unter die Brücke gebaut worden ist?"

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_2.tmx:
msgid "Am I wasting my life?"
msgstr "Verschwende ich mein Leben?"

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_2.tmx:
msgid "Did I forget to sleep this week?"
msgstr "Habe ich diese Woche vergessen zu schlafen?"

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_2.tmx:
msgid "Does this make any sense?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_2.tmx:
msgid "Bugs? Bugs? There are no bugs here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/74.tmx:
msgid "Are you interested in this stone? I just found it but I can't take it with me, it weighs too much."
msgstr "Hast du Interesse an diesem Stein? Ich habe ihn gerade gefunden, aber kann ihn nicht mitnehmem, er wiegt zu viel."

#: assets/maps/story/74.tmx:
msgid "This is a very strange stone…"
msgstr "Das ist ein merkwürdiger Stein…"

#: assets/maps/story/74.tmx:
msgid "In my opinion that stone shouldn't have been here."
msgstr "Meiner Meinung nach sollte dieser Stein hier nicht gewesen sein."

#: assets/maps/story/74.tmx:
msgid "In the ardent embrace, life is born again"
msgstr "In brennender Umarmung wird das Leben wiedergeboren"

#: assets/maps/story/2_house.tmx:
msgid "You are the chosen one for this year, right?\nMy son was too, many years ago."
msgstr "Du bist der Auserwählte für dieses Jahr, richtig?\nMein Sohn war das vor vielen Jahren auch mal."

#: assets/maps/story/2_house.tmx:
msgid "Unfortunately he failed to defeat the King of Evil…"
msgstr "Leider gelang es ihm nicht, den König des Bösen zu besiegen…"

#: assets/maps/story/2_house.tmx:
msgid "Now you're unemployed, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/2_house.tmx:
msgid "Many before you have failed, but I am sure you will handle it right."
msgstr "Viele vor Dir sind gescheitert, aber ich bin mir sicher, dass Du es gut machen wirst."

#: assets/maps/story/2_house.tmx:
msgid "I knew you would make it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Welcome to the City Hall."
msgstr "Willkommen im Rathaus."

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "{{hero}}!\nNice to meet you, I am ON VII, the king of the Water Region.\nI was told you freed Hana's Tunnel from the Hoarfrost Team, thanks a lot!\nThe tunnel had been blocked for weeks."
msgstr "{{hero}}!\nSchön dich kennenzulernen, ich bin ON VII, König der Wasserregion.\nMir wurde gesagt, du habest Hana's Tunnel von Team Raureif befreit. Hierfür gebührt dir Dank.\nDer Tunnel war seit Wochen blockiert."

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "My duty!\nBy the way, King Xe III gave me this package for you."
msgstr "Zu Diensten!\nÜbrigens, König Xe III hat mir dieses Paket für Euch gegeben."

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Oh thank you, it's medicine for my back pain.\nYou know, sitting all day…\nSome plants in the Mitsu Forest are miraculous to solve these problems.\nWhere are you headed?"
msgstr "Oh danke, das ist Medizin für meine Rückenschmerzen.\nWeißt du, das ganze Sitzen Tag ein Tag aus...\nManche Pflanzen des Mitsuwaldes sind wunderbar um bei derartigen Problemen Linderung zu erreichen.\nWohin bist du unterwegs?"

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "I have to go to the Fire Region."
msgstr "Ich muss zur Feuerregion."

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Oh, do you want to leave the region already?\nThis saddens me.\nTo go to the Fire Region you have to take a boat that you find west of here.\nYou need my written permission, here it is."
msgstr "Oh, du willst die Gegend schon verlassen? Das macht mich traurig.\nUm zur Feuerregion zu gelangen, musst du ein Boot westlich von hier nehmen. \nDu brauchst meine schriftliche Erlaubnis -\nhier bitte."

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Thank you!\nI will come back sooner or later."
msgstr "Ich danke Euch!\nIch werde früher oder später zurückkehren."

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "In my region you are always welcome."
msgstr "In meiner Region wirst du immer willkommen sein."

#: assets/maps/story/53_cityhall.tmx:
msgid "Welcome back hero!\nI'm glad you came back to visit us."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/32.tmx:
msgid "Relax and enjoy the sea."
msgstr "Entspanne Dich und genieße das Meer."

#: assets/maps/story/32.tmx:
msgid "Wow! I had never seen the sea before!"
msgstr "Wow! Ich war noch nie am Meer!"

#: assets/maps/story/32.tmx:
msgid "It's very calm and relaxing."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/32.tmx:
msgid "The sea is very calm and relaxing."
msgstr "Das Meer ist sehr ruhig und entspannend."

#: assets/maps/story/32.tmx:
msgid "Welcome to the Water Region! Enjoy your stay."
msgstr "Willkommen im Wasserland! Habe einen angenehmen Aufenthalt."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Look who's here… This year's \"hero\".\nWe took out the heroes of past years, we will take you out too."
msgstr "Na, sieh mal einer an... Der diesjährige \"Held\".\nWir haben die Helden der vergangenen Jahre vernichtet, Dich werden wir auch vernichten."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "W-who are you?! What do you want?!"
msgstr "W-Wer bist du?! Was willst du?!"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "You don't seem particularly informed, kid.\nAt least those before you had the basics.\nThey should choose \"heroes\" more carefully.\nWe are the Hoarfrost Team!\nWe are the professionals of crime.\nThe King of Evil's right-hand men.\nThanks to us, the King of Evil will be able to complete his work."
msgstr "Du scheinst nicht wirklich gut informiert zu sein, Junge.\nDeine Vorgänger kannten zumindest die Grundlagen.\nSie sollten \"Helden\" sorgsamer auswählen.\nWir sind das Raureif-Team!\nWir sind Profis im Verbrechen.\nDes Königs des Bösen rechte Hand.\nDank uns wird der König des Bösen dazu fähig sein, sein Werk zu vervollständigen."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "His work?! What are you talking about?"
msgstr "Sein Werk?! Wovon redest Du?"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Hehe, we don't reveal our plans to you, kid.\nWe're not stupid.\nAnd anyway, even if we told you everything, it wouldn't do you any good, since we're going to take you out now."
msgstr "Hehe, Dir werden wir unsere Pläne nicht verraten Kind!\nWir sind nicht blöd.\nUnd überhaupt, selbst wenn wir Dir alles erzählen würden, würde es Dir nicht weiter helfen, da wir Dich jetzt erledigen werden."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "You won't catch me!"
msgstr "Du wirst mich nicht fangen!"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "You can't run away from here.\nDid you think you could get away with it that easily?\nThe fact that you tried to escape and not to fight makes it clear how little value you are.\nI hope next year's \"hero\" is a little braver than you, at least it would be a bit more fun for us."
msgstr "Du kannst hier nicht entkommen.\nDachtest du, dass du damit so einfach davon kommst?\nDer Umstand, dass du weglaufen und nicht kämpfen wolltest, zeigt wie wertlos du bist.\nIch hoffe der nächstjährige \"Held\" ist mutiger als du, das wäre zumindest unterhaltsamer für uns."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Bzzt… Bzzt… Bzzt…"
msgstr "Bzzt… Bzzt… Bzzt…"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "phone"
msgstr "Telefon"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "What's happening?"
msgstr "Was passiert hier?"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "This year's \"hero\".\nWe just caught him."
msgstr "Der diesjährige »Held«.\nWir haben ihn gerade gefangen."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Very well."
msgstr "Nun gut."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Do we get rid of him?"
msgstr "Sollen wir ihn loswerden?"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Does he look smart?"
msgstr "Sieht er intelligent aus?"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "No."
msgstr "Nein."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Then let him go."
msgstr "Dann lasst ihn gehen."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "WHAT?!\nAre you sure? Why have him around again?"
msgstr "WAAAS?\nBist du sicher? Warum sollen wir ihn frei herumlaufen lassen?"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "He has to go through me anyway if he wants to continue his journey.\nI'll get rid of him."
msgstr "Er muss sowieso an mir vorbei, wenn er seine Reise fortsetzen möchte.\nIch werde ihn beseitigen."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "But what if he makes trouble and…"
msgstr "Aber was, wenn er Probleme bereitet und…"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Do not insist. It's my final decision."
msgstr "Hör auf, zu diskutieren. Meine Entscheidung ist endgültig."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "But boss, we can't risk that he will…"
msgstr "Aber Meister, wir können nicht riskieren, dass er…"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "You will still get your reward, don't worry."
msgstr "Ihr werdet eure Belohnung bekommen, keine Sorge."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Ah okay, perfect. We leave it free.\nSee you later boss."
msgstr "Ah okay, perfekt. Wir lassen es frei.\nBis später, Meister."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "Beep… Beep… Beep…"
msgstr "Biep … Biep … Biep …"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "You got lucky this time.\nBut soon you will be dealing with our boss."
msgstr "Dieses Mal hattest Du Glück.\nDoch bald wirst Du es mit unserem Meister zu tun bekommen."

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "The King of Evil?"
msgstr "Der König des Bösen?"

#: assets/maps/story/25.tmx:
msgid "No, kid. We were in communication with the leader of Hoarfrost Team.\nHe will take care of you.\nIn any case, we keep an eye on you.\nWe wish you the worst."
msgstr "Nein, Junge. Wir standen in Kontakt mit dem Anführer des Raufreif-Teams.\nEr wird sich um Dich kümmern.\nJedenfalls werden wir dich im Auge behalten.\nWir wünschen Dir das Schlimmste."

#: assets/maps/story/71.tmx:
msgid "Route 9"
msgstr "Route 9"

#: assets/maps/story/71.tmx:
msgid "We won! We are strong!\nI go to rest."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/71.tmx:
msgid "* Milla disappears into the leaf *"
msgstr "* Milla verschwindet ins Blatt *"

#: assets/maps/story/x8.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 8F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x8.tmx:
msgid "An easy win.\nLet's move on."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x8.tmx:
msgid "Stay focused!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/69_house2.tmx:
msgid "We pride ourselves on our traditions, such as the fire dance, to honor the power of the volcano and appease its spirits."
msgstr "Wir sind stolz auf unsere Traditionen, so wie den Feuertanz, um die Kraft des Vulkans zu ehren und seine Geister zu besänftigen."

#: assets/maps/story/69_house2.tmx:
msgid "Legends tell of an ancient guardian who protects the volcano.\nWe see it as a symbol of hope and security."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Archocean City"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "I like this city!"
msgstr "Mir gefällt diese Stadt!"

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Hey, welcome to Archocean City!\nWe have the best view in the whole Kingdom!\nHere we live between the sky and the water, have you noticed that?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "This city is very expensive."
msgstr "Diese Stadt ist sehr teuer."

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "It was supposed to be a short holiday but it's lasting longer than expected."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "My boyfriend took me here for a short holiday.\nHow wonderful!"
msgstr "Mein Freund hat mich zu einem Kurzurlaub hierhergebracht.\nWie wundervoll!"

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Today is my day off."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Don't worry, the bridge is very solid.\nIt has already collapsed 2 times but this time it was done a little better.\nI'm sure we've learned from our mistakes by now.\nDon't worry."
msgstr "Keine Sorge, die Brücke ist sehr stabil.\nSie ist bereits zweimal eingebrochen, aber dieses mal wurde sie etwas besser wiederaufgebaut.\nIch bin mir sicher, dass wir mittlerweile von unseren Fehlern gelernt haben.\nKeine Sorge."

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Oh how wonderful!"
msgstr "Oh wie schön!"

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Hey, that's not fair.\nI can only see the wall!"
msgstr "Hey, das ist unfair.\nIch kann nur die Wand sehen!"

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Not my problem."
msgstr "Nicht mein Problem."

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "I wish I had a camera."
msgstr "Ich wünschte ich hätte eine Kamera."

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "Ok, that's enough.\nBye."
msgstr "Ok, genug.\nBaba."

#: assets/maps/story/53.tmx:
msgid "From here I can only see the wall."
msgstr "Von hier aus sehe ich nur die Wand."

#: assets/maps/story/46_house.tmx:
msgid "Our family has been building boats for over 140 years.\nWe are good at it."
msgstr "Unsere Familie baut seit über 140 Jahren Boote.\nDarin sind wir gut."

#: assets/maps/story/46_house.tmx:
msgid "Welcome to our boat store!\nAre you looking for a boat to explore the vast ocean or to transport your goods?\nI am here to help you find the right boat for your needs!\nMotorized, rowing, sailing, white, coloured, fast, resistant, large, small…"
msgstr "Willkommen in unserem Bootsgeschäft!\nSuchst du ein Boot um die weite See zu erkunden oder um Güter zu transportieren?\nIch helfe gerne das richtige Boot für deine Bedürnisse zu finden!\nMit Motor, Ruder, Segel, weiß, farbig, schnell, widerstandsfähig, groß oder klein…"

#: assets/maps/story/46_house.tmx:
msgid "These I see all look exactly the same to me…"
msgstr "Die, die ich da sehe, sehen für mich alle gleich aus…"

#: assets/maps/story/46_house.tmx:
msgid "It's because you don't understand anything about boats!"
msgstr "Ja, weil du nichts von Booten verstehst!"

#: assets/maps/story/46_house.tmx:
msgid "Remember, a good boat can mean the difference between life and death in these dangerous seas!"
msgstr "Vergiss nicht, ein gutes Boot kann auf diesen gefährlichen Gewässern den Unterschied zwischen Leben und Tod ausmachen!"

#: assets/maps/story/46_house.tmx:
msgid "Hmm, should I take the faster boat or the one with the beer fridge?\nI don't know, I don't know…"
msgstr "Hmm, soll ich das schnellere Boot oder das mit dem Bierkühlschrank nehmen?\nIch weiß nicht, ich weiß nicht…"

#: assets/maps/story/x4.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 4F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/35.tmx:
msgid "This boulder is very heavy."
msgstr "Dieser Felsen ist ziemlich schwer."

#: assets/maps/story/35.tmx:
msgid "We are trying to move this boulder.\nI'm sorry but it's going to take a while."
msgstr "Wir versuchen, diesen Felsen aus dem Weg zu räumen.\nTut mir Leid, aber das wird wohl einige Zeit dauern."

#: assets/maps/story/35.tmx:
msgid "A heavy rock."
msgstr "Ein schwerer Felsen."

#: assets/maps/story/35.tmx:
msgid "↑ Hexa Cave"
msgstr "↑ Hexa-Höhle"

#: assets/maps/story/35.tmx:
msgid "Aquaville Town →"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/21_house.tmx:
msgid "I hate product placements."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/21_house.tmx:
msgid "They are playing Quinb! It looks like they are having a lot of fun!"
msgstr "Sie spielen Quinb! Sieht so aus, als hätten sie viel Spaß!"

#: assets/maps/story/21_house.tmx:
msgid "Sorry, I have to stay focused."
msgstr "Entschuldigung, ich muss konzentriert bleiben."

#: assets/maps/story/21_house.tmx:
msgid "I love Quinb!"
msgstr "Ich liebe Quinb!"

#: assets/maps/story/21_house.tmx:
msgid "I always lose, but this time it's going better than usual."
msgstr "Ich verliere immer, aber diesmal läufts besser als sonst."

#: assets/maps/story/21_house.tmx:
msgid "They are playing Quinb!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 2F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Watch out, there are monsters here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Finally some fun!\nWho fights besides me?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Of course I fight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "I'll help you too!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "I don't like to fight, I'll leave it to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Ok, so it's me, September and Milla."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "What a dream team."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Best trio ever."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "I stay here. I'll join you later."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "These monsters are not very scary."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "You go ahead in the next floors, I'll join you later.\nIf there are monsters I prefer to stay safe here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Yes, you'll manage without me anyway."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x2.tmx:
msgid "Ok fine, see you later."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 7F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "What are those things?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "Seventh floor. I think we're more than halfway through."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "She amuses herself easily."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "?\nWhat are those arrows?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "I don't know! Try getting on it and see if anything happens."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "Let's try."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "Uh?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "They change the direction you're going."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "That's so nice. It looks like a lot of fun."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "Not that much."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x7.tmx:
msgid "I like it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "I still don't understand why I lose money when I run out of HP."
msgstr "Ich verstehe immer noch nicht, warum ich Geld verliere, wenn mir die LP ausgehen."

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "← Sacred Tree"
msgstr "← Heiliger Baum"

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Greentwig City Center →"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Milla!"
msgstr "Milla!"

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Hi hero!\nDid you get the first signet? Well done!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Are you going to the Greentwig City center?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Yes, have you been there?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "I'm from there!\nBut there's nothing special, it's a very boooring city.\nIn tourist guides, the \"Museum of rocking chairs\" is listed as the most interesting attraction.\nBut apparently it has closed down."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Oh, what a pity."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "However, a visit to the City Hall is worthwhile. It's so spacious!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Ok, thanks I'll visit it.\nHow's your journey going?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "It's going well, even if sometimes traveling alone can get a bit boring…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Ah, I'm also a bit bored actually."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Really?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Yes, but I've been trained for this too."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Oh."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "As my father says, a true hero knows no boredom!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "It must have been hard to spend most of your life preparing for this journey."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "A little bit, but the legend is clear: every year a hero has to leave, until the King of Evil is defeated.\nI couldn't escape this commitment."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "I too wanted to be a hero.\nBut my parents didn't let me participate in the selections."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Ouf!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "It's better this way, trust me.\nIt's a hard life for heroes.\nIn fact, I don't even have time to rest for a moment that I already have to go to the next place.\n\"Sleep is for the weak, not for heroes\".\nAccording to plan, I should have already reached the Water Region.\nSo maybe it's better if i go now."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Oh, ok."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Then see you around, hero!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/27.tmx:
msgid "Oops… Sorry."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house3.tmx:
msgid "All the social life of this city takes place on these roofs.\nWhat a nuisance."
msgstr "Das gesamte gesellschaftliche Leben dieser Stadt spielt sich auf diesen Dächern ab.\nWas für eine Belästigung."

#: assets/maps/story/53_house3.tmx:
msgid "Oink !"
msgstr "Oink!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Xeonjia Tower"
msgstr "Xeonjia-Turm"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "The toweeeeer!"
msgstr "Der Tuuuuuurm!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Hi Milla!"
msgstr "Hallo Milla!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Hii {{hero}}!"
msgstr "Hii {{hero}}!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Are you ok? Did you get here without any problems?"
msgstr "Geht es Dir gut? Bist Du problemlos hergekommen?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Yes! No problem at all!"
msgstr "Ja! Überhaupt gar kein Problem!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Have you seen those little green worms?\nThey are so cute!"
msgstr "Hast Du diese kleinen grünen Würmer gesehen?\nSie sind so süß!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "…C-cute?? You have strange tastes."
msgstr "… S-Süß?? Du hast einen seltsamen Geschmack."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Anyway…\n…I had to defeat them all."
msgstr "Wie dem auch sei …\n… ich musste sie alle besiegen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Nooooo!"
msgstr "Neeeeein!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I hope they are okay now…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Y-yes… Sure…\n…\nBy the way, where are we?"
msgstr "J-Ja... Sicher...\n...\nÜbrigens, wo sind wir eigentlich?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "This is the tower where the King of Evil resides!"
msgstr "Das ist der Turm, wo sich der König des Bösen aufhält!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Oh really? Are we there yet?"
msgstr "Echt? Sind wir schon da?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "It seems so… but it's closed!\nThis nice gentleman here explained to me that to access the tower you need 3 signets."
msgstr "Es scheint so...aber er ist verschlossen!\nDer nette Mann hier erklärte mir, dass man drei Siegel braucht, um den Turm zu betreten."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Signets?"
msgstr "Siegel?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I did not understand exactly what they are, but they should be items that are placed in crypts in each region of the Kingdom.\n3 crypts with one signet each."
msgstr "Ich habe nicht genau verstanden, was sie sind, aber das sollen Gegenstände sein, welche in jeder Region des Königsreichs in Krypten platziert wurden.\nDrei Krypten mit je einem Siegel."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Okay, it doesn't sound complicated.\nIn this region for now I have not yet found the crypt.\nIt might be in the southeast.\nWhere are you headed now?"
msgstr "Okay, das hört sich nicht schwer an.\nIn dieser Region habe ich bis jetzt noch keine Krypta gefunden.\nSie befindet sich möglicherweise im Südosten.\nWohin gehst Du jetzt?"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I think I will stay here and rest for a while, near the Mitsu Forest.\nI will resume my journey in a few days."
msgstr "Ich denke, ich werde hier bleiben und mich für eine Weile ausruhen, nahe des Mitsuwaldes.\nIn wenigen Tagen werde ich meine Reise fortsetzen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I can't rest so much unfortunately.\nI'll continue my journey right away.\nHave a good rest!"
msgstr "Ich kann mich leider nicht so viel ausruhen.\nIch werde unverzüglich weiterreisen.\nErhol Dich gut!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Thanks!\nWe will meet again."
msgstr "Danke!\nWir werden uns wieder sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Good luck {{hero}}!"
msgstr "Viel Glück, {{hero}}!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Do your best!"
msgstr "Gib Dein Bestes!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I hate this little girl here… She pestered me with a thousand questions and she cried until I told her what she wanted.\nHow impertinent."
msgstr "Ich hasse dieses kleine Mädchen hier... Sie bedrängte mich mit tausend Fragen und weinte bis ich ihr sagte, was sie wollte.\nWie unverfroren."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "One signet is not enough."
msgstr "Ein Siegel reicht nicht aus."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Two signets are not enough."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "September!"
msgstr "September!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Here you are finally."
msgstr "Da bist du endlich."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "She has the third signet."
msgstr "Sie hat das dritte Siegel."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Of course I took it, {{hero}} is too slow."
msgstr "Natürlich hab ichs genommen, {{hero}} war zu langsam."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "The Spirit of Fire is warming up the tower right now."
msgstr "Der Feuergeist wärmt gerade den Turm auf."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "So everything is ready, with the three signets we can enter."
msgstr "Also ist alles bereit, mit den drei Siegeln können wir eintreten."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "From now on, maximum concentration, today we save the world.\nHere's the third signet, I give you the honor to open the door."
msgstr "Von hier an ist höchste Konzentration gefragt; heute retten wir die Welt.\nHier hast du das dritte Siegel, ich überlasse dir die Ehre das Tor zu öffnen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "What an unexpected kindness."
msgstr "Welch unerwartete Nettigkeit."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Only because you have 2 signets and I only have 1.\nYou beat me."
msgstr "Aber nur weil du zwei Siegel hast und ich nur eines.\nDu hast mich geschlagen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} uses the 3 signets *"
msgstr "* {{hero}} wendet die drei Siegel an *"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "The door has unlocked, we can enter!"
msgstr "Das Tor ist offen, wir können eintreten!"

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I am the 65th hero… I had my Departure Day but a few weeks later I found out that you had already won."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "65th hero"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "Xeonjia Tower – Dwelling of the King of Evil. Stay away."
msgstr "Xeonjia-Turm – Wohnsitz des König des Bösen. Kein Zutritt."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "This door is closed, I need the 3 signets to open it."
msgstr "Diese Tür ist verschlossen. Ich brauche drei Siegel, um sie zu öffnen."

#: assets/maps/story/999.tmx:
msgid "I should go to the tower."
msgstr "Ich sollte zum Turm gehen."

#: assets/maps/story/16.tmx:
msgid "Exit ←"
msgstr "Ausgang ←"

#: assets/maps/story/37_house.tmx:
msgid "I love studying history and literature."
msgstr "Ich liebe es, Geschichte und Literatur zu studieren."

#: assets/maps/story/37_house.tmx:
msgid "[…] but half of the army defected, made a deal with the King of Evil and founded the Hoarfrost Team. That moment decreed our defeat."
msgstr "[…] doch die Hälfte der Armee ist übergelaufen, haben einen Deal mit dem König des Bösen gemacht und gründeten das Raureif-Team. Dieser Moment besiegelte unsere Niederlage."

#: assets/maps/story/37_house.tmx:
msgid "This book tells what happened 65 years ago."
msgstr "Dieses Buch erzählt davon, was vor 65 Jahren geschah."

#: assets/maps/story/37_house.tmx:
msgid "There are math notes here."
msgstr "Hier sind Mathematik-Notizen."

#: assets/maps/story/70.tmx:
msgid "Fumarole Town"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70.tmx:
msgid "I don't have time to waste with you right now."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70.tmx:
msgid "dr. lache"
msgstr "Dr. Lache"

#: assets/maps/story/25_house.tmx:
msgid "I'm a little confused."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/25_house.tmx:
msgid "I'm planning a surprise wedding for my son.\nI hope he doesn't find out."
msgstr "Ich plane eine Überraschungshochzeit für meinen Sohn.\nIch hoffe, er findet es nicht heraus."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Home"
msgstr "Zuhause"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "We don't have much to do."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Good morning mom!"
msgstr "Guten Morgen, Mama!"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Hi {{hero}}!\nDid you sleep well?"
msgstr "Hi {{hero}}!\nGut geschlafen?"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "mom"
msgstr "Mama"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Actually not very well… I'm still a little sleepy."
msgstr "Ehrlich gesagt, nicht so gut... Ich bin immer noch etwas verschlafen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "You always are.\nYou can't afford to be tired, from today you are officially the new hero."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "My little hero!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Do not call me that!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Did you get everything?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Yes, it's all ready.\nNow it's time to leave."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Be very careful and remember to check your health in the top left bar."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Yea mom, I know. I am no longer a child."
msgstr "Ja, Mama, ich weiß. Ich bin kein Kind mehr."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "I know, I know.\nGo, my darling, and make your mother proud.\nAh, and don't forget that the neighbor wanted to give you some food before you leave."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Sure mom, I will stop by our neighbor."
msgstr "Natürlich, Mama, ich werde bei unserem Nachbarn vorbeischauen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Bye, my little hero!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Go get the food from the neighbor."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "The food the neighbor gave you looks tasty!"
msgstr "Das Essen, dass Dir die Nachbarn gegeben haben, sieht sehr lecker aus!"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Hi {{hero}}, everything okay?\nYou missed your mom, right?"
msgstr "Hi {{hero}}, alles in Ordnung?\nDu hast deine Mutter vermisst, oder?"

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Hi my little hero!\nAre you going to spend more hours awake or asleep today?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "Unfortunately, this is not the time to lie down on the sofa."
msgstr "Leider ist jetzt nicht der richtige Zeitpunkt, um auf dem Sofa zu liegen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "This sofa is very comfortable."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_home.tmx:
msgid "This plant seems to have been recently watered."
msgstr "Diese Pflanze scheint kürzlich gegossen worden zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/4_house.tmx:
msgid "The last time I went through the forest I was attacked.\nI'm not going back there anymore."
msgstr "Das letzte Mal, als ich durch den Wald ging, wurde ich angegriffen.\nIch werde dort nicht mehr hingehen."

#: assets/maps/story/4_house.tmx:
msgid "Even if it's safe now."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/4_house.tmx:
msgid "If you want to enter the forest you have to be careful, my grandson risked getting hurt there."
msgstr "Wenn Du in Wald möchtest, solltest Du vorsichtig sein. Mein Enkelsohn wurde dort fast verletzt."

#: assets/maps/story/4_house.tmx:
msgid "There are no more monsters in the Mitsu Forest."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/62.tmx:
msgid "Hey, there is something here!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "Do you think piglets will one day be a common pet?"
msgstr "Glaubst Du, dass Ferkel eines Tages ein normales Haustier sein werden?"

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "I think so too."
msgstr "Das glaube ich auch."

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "Oh, I hope you are not right."
msgstr "Oh, ich hoffe Du irrst Dich."

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "I like piglets."
msgstr "Ich mag Ferkel."

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "Remove the casing and loosen the screws until panel B2 reaches…"
msgstr "Entferne das Gehäuse und löse die Schrauben, bis Platte B2…"

#: assets/maps/story/26_house.tmx:
msgid "This is the manual for assembling a library."
msgstr "Das ist die Anleitung für die Zusammenstellung einer Bibliothek."

#: assets/maps/story/50_house.tmx:
msgid "Zoysii?\nI've heard this name before…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/50_house.tmx:
msgid "Hello! I am the official florist of the Region!\nThe most beautiful flowers? Zoysii!"
msgstr "Hallo! Ich bin der offizielle Florist dieser Region!\nDie schönsten Blumen? Zoysii!"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_03.tmx:
msgid "MOSSY CRYPT – B3F"
msgstr "Moosbewachsene Krypta – 3. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_03.tmx:
msgid "My work is so boring…"
msgstr "Meine Arbeit ist so öde…"

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 10F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "iosa&joza"
msgstr "Iosa & Joza"

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "You know, {{hero}}, you and I are not that different.\nI acted for the highest good.\nThis is a sick world.\nIt must be healed and that's why difficult decisions must be made. And I took that responsibility upon myself.\nThe only way to restore order is through chaos.\nYou will understand it too sooner or later."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "Nobody can stop us!\nLet's move on."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "The situation is getting critical."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "This was also an easy win.\nLet's move on."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "What do you want?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "I will defeat you."
msgstr "Ich werde Dich besiegen."

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "Dr. Lache!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "Very well. Here you are, {{hero}}.\nI admit I didn't think you'd make it, I underestimated you.\nNo hero has ever come this far.\nCongratulations, you've come a long way and I recognize your worth, but you missed one thing.\nYou did not understand the greatness of my vision.\nIt will be thanks to me that all the rottenness of this world will be eradicated.\nOrder arises out of destruction."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "Who is this braggart?\nLet's defeat him and go to the King of Evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "How rude your friend."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "We didn't come all this way here to hear your craziness.\nLet's fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "Don't talk to our boss like that."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "He deserves respect."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "Apologize to him!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "How cute, they talk together!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "I don't need their apologies.\nTheir rudeness is the result of this sick society.\nIt makes me realize once again that what we are doing is right and necessary.\nLet's get rid of them now.\nYou have come all this way in vain because your end has come."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "You seem a little overconfident."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "Now I'll show you the reason for my confidence."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "iosa"
msgstr "Iosa"

#: assets/maps/story/x10.tmx:
msgid "joza"
msgstr "Joza"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Route 5"
msgstr "Route 5"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Ok, you were better than me.\nI still have room for improvement, I will continue to train."
msgstr "Okay, Du warst besser als ich.\nIch muss noch besser werden, also werde ich weiter trainieren."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Anyway, it is good to see you again."
msgstr "Jedenfalls, es ist schön, Dich wieder zu sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "It is good to see you too.\nDuring the battle it felt like I was going back to when we were kids."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Hehe, you are right… we spent a lot of hours playing and training as kids.\nThat was the happiest time in my life…\nThis is too much nostalgia for me. I can't handle it."
msgstr "Hehe, Du hast recht... wir haben als Kinder viele Stunden damit verbracht, zu spielen und zu trainieren.\nDas war die schönste Zeit meines Lebens...\nDas ist zu viel Nostalgie für mich. Damit kann ich nicht umgehen."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I don't have time for these emotions, I have to go back to training now.\nSee you in the Xeonjia Tower."
msgstr "Ich habe keine Zeit für diese Emotionen, ich muss jetzt zurück zum Trainieren.\nWir sehen uns im Xeonjia-Turm."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Are you going to the tower too?"
msgstr "Du gehst auch zum Turm?"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Yes, of course!\nI will go there and I will defeat the King of Evil!\nEven though you are the protagonist and the so-called \"Hero\", it will be me who will defeat the King of Evil and be remembered as the savior of the world hehe."
msgstr "Ja, natürlich!\nIch werde dort den König des Bösen niederstrecken!\nSelbst wenn Du der sogenannte „Held“ sein magst, werde ich es sein, die den König besiegt und für immer als Retterin der Welt in die Geschichte eingeht!"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Wait, wait, wait, don't steal my job! Haha."
msgstr "Warte, das ist meine Aufgabe! Haha."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Hey you two, don't waste energy on each other!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I saw that you were fighting."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Did you also see that I won?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Did you also see that he was lucky?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Yes, yes, I have seen everything."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "But do you two know each other?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "September and I? Of course! We are best friends!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "We are accomplices in scientific experiments and inventions."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "We made the snowball container together."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I made it and she tried it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "That's what I said, we did it together."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Now I leave you because I have to go back to training."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Yeah, I think we all have important things to do now."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "See you soon!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I lost my glasses. I hardly see anything."
msgstr "Ich hab meine Brille verloren. Ich sehe gar nichts."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Are these your glasses?"
msgstr "Ist dies Deine Brille?"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Yes! Thank you so much!"
msgstr "Ja, vielen Dank!"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "As a reward I give you this gem that I found while I was looking for the glasses."
msgstr "Zum Dank gebe ich Dir diesen Kristall, den ich auf der Suche nach meiner Brille gefunden habe."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "Oh, thank you so much!"
msgstr "Oh, vielen Dank!"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I missed being able to see the sea."
msgstr "Ich hatte es vermisst, mir das Meer anschauen zu können."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I can't believe it took you this long!\nLet's fight!"
msgstr "Du hast echt lange gebraucht!\nLass uns kämpfen!"

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "I have heard that in each region there is a strange polyhedric stone."
msgstr "Ich habe gehört, dass es in jeder Region einen seltsamen polyedrischen Stein gibt."

#: assets/maps/story/39.tmx:
msgid "This one seems to be useless."
msgstr "Dieser scheint nutzlos zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/11.tmx:
msgid "Hi, I'm an employee of the Kingdom.\nIf you get lost or have problems finding the way, come back to me and I'll help you."
msgstr "Hallo, ich bin ein Beamter des Königreichs.\nWenn du dich verirrst oder Probleme hast den Weg zu finden, komm zu mir und ich werde dir helfen."

#: assets/maps/story/11.tmx:
msgid "Are you stuck?\nTake the path behind the blue tree."
msgstr "Kommst Du nicht weiter?\nNimm den Pfad hinter dem blauen Baum."

#: assets/maps/story/3_house1.tmx:
msgid "A few meters from here is the Mitsu Forest.\nOnce it attracted many tourists as it was considered a sacred place, but now it's dangerous and infested with monsters."
msgstr "Wenige Meter von hier entfernt ist der Mitsuwald.\nEinst zog er viele Touristen an, da er als heiliger Ort galt, doch jetzt ist er gefährlich und wimmelt von Monstern."

#: assets/maps/story/3_house1.tmx:
msgid "A few meters from here is the Mitsu Forest."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Hoarfrost Team members came to our house because they wanted a gem that I found on the ground.\nWe managed to keep it hidden from them but we don't want to have problems anymore.\nWe don't even need it after all, can we give it to you?"
msgstr "Einige Mitglieder vom Raureif-Team kamen zu unserem Haus, weil sie einen Edelstein haben wollten, den ich auf dem Boden gefunden hatte.\nWir konnten ihn vor denen verbergen, aber wir wollen keinen weiteren Ärger.\nWir brauchen ihn auch gar nicht. Können wir ihn Dir geben?"

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Here's to you!"
msgstr "Hier, bitte!"

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Oh, ok. Then I'll have to think about what to do with this gem."
msgstr "Oh, ok. Dann muss ich mir überlegen, was ich mit diesem Schmuckstück anfangen soll."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Protect that gem well."
msgstr "Schütze dieses Schmuckstück gut."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Be careful when dealing with the Hoarfrost Team."
msgstr "Sei vorsichtig, wenn du auf das Raureif-Team triffst."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Mind your own business."
msgstr "Kümmer Dich um deinen eigenen Kram."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "After 10 minutes add to the pot half a daikon, chopped into small pieces…"
msgstr "Gib nach 10 Minuten einen halben, klein gehackten Winterrettich in den Topf…"

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "I'm getting hungry."
msgstr "Ich werde langsam hungrig."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "This vase is very heavy, I can't move it."
msgstr "Diese Vase ist sehr schwer, ich kann sie nicht bewegen."

#: assets/maps/story/28_house.tmx:
msgid "Yes thanks"
msgstr "Ja, danke"

#: assets/maps/story/x11.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 11F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x11.tmx:
msgid "I'm starting to get hungry."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x11.tmx:
msgid "I think that this is the last floor before the King of Evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/46.tmx:
msgid "Route 6"
msgstr "Route 6"

#: assets/maps/story/46.tmx:
msgid "Were you able to chase away the Hoarfrost Team?!\nThank you, it had been months since the tunnel was blocked.\nYou must be thirsty, here's this bottle of water for you."
msgstr "Konntest du das Raureifteam verjagen?!\nVielen Dank, seit Monaten ist der Tunnel blockiert.\nDu musst durstig sein, hier nimm diese Flasche Wasser."

#: assets/maps/story/46.tmx:
msgid "The Hana's Tunnel connects the 2 parts of the region."
msgstr "Hana's Tunnel verbindet die zwei Teile dieser Region."

#: assets/maps/story/46.tmx:
msgid "Hana's Tunnel"
msgstr "Hana's Tunnel"

#: assets/maps/story/46.tmx:
msgid "Boats boats! – Custom-made boat store"
msgstr "Boote, Boote! – nach Wunsch gefertigt"

#: assets/maps/story/43_tower_1.tmx:
msgid "Observation Tower"
msgstr "Wachturm"

#: assets/maps/story/66_house.tmx:
msgid "Hi, you look a little tired. Rest here for a moment."
msgstr "Hallo, Du siehst etwas müde aus. Ruh Dich doch hier einen Moment aus."

#: assets/maps/story/66_house.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} rested and is now in perfect health *"
msgstr "* {{hero}} hat sich ausgeruht und ist nun top fit *"

#: assets/maps/story/66_house.tmx:
msgid "Come back anytime."
msgstr "Komm jederzeit wieder."

#: assets/maps/story/66_house.tmx:
msgid "Be careful not to get hurt."
msgstr "Pass gut auf, dass du Dir nicht wehtust."

#: assets/maps/story/66_house.tmx:
msgid "Compared to my previous adventures, this climb will be the most ardent. It's better to be prepared and fully rested."
msgstr "Im Vergleich zu meinen bisherigen Abenteuern wird dieser Aufstieg der anstrengendste. Ich bereite mich besser gut vor und ruhe mich aus."

#: assets/maps/story/67.tmx:
#, fuzzy
msgid "Flamecot City"
msgstr "Flamecot-Stadt"

#: assets/maps/story/67.tmx:
msgid "I have to take the signet."
msgstr "Ich muss das Siegel nehmen."

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "NEIGHBOR'S HOUSE"
msgstr "NACHBARHAUS"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "Hello lad, are you all right?\nToday is the big day, huh?\nBe careful, the world is a dangerous place.\nI made you this box full of food, you will need it when you have few HP.\nHere's to you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "neighbor"
msgstr "Nachbar"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "Thank you very much!\nIt looks delicious!"
msgstr "Vielen, vielen Dank!\nEs sieht lecker aus!"

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "My box full of food made you win. So it's basically me who saved the world."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
#, fuzzy
msgid "It's the first time an inhabitant of this town has been chosen as a \"hero\".\nI'm so happy."
msgstr "Es ist das erste Mal, dass ein Bewohner dieses Dorfs als \"Held\" ausgewählt wurde.\nIch freu mich so sehr."

#: assets/maps/story/1_house.tmx:
msgid "The \"Last Hero\" is an inhabitant of this town!\nI'm so happy."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "This city is boring."
msgstr "Diese Stadt ist langweilig."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "I'm sorry but this road is closed.\nWork is underway to restore the railway system."
msgstr "Es tut mir leid, aber diese Straße ist gesperrt.\nZurzeit wird das Schienensystem wieder aufgebaut."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "I can't wait till they finish to restore the railway system, it hasn't worked since the arrival of ice."
msgstr "Ich kann es kaum erwarten, dass sie die Restaurierung der Eisenbahn beenden, die seit dem Eiseinbruch nicht mehr funktioniert."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "My wife got stuck far away, I wonder if I will ever see her again."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "City Hall ↑"
msgstr "Rathaus ↑"

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "Route 4 →"
msgstr "Route 4 →"

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "Before continuing I'd like to visit the City Hall."
msgstr "Ich möchte vorher noch das Rathaus besuchen."

#: assets/maps/story/30.tmx:
msgid "The City Hall seems spacious."
msgstr "Das Rathaus scheint geräumig zu sein."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Great, it worked.\nBut… do you have to appear on my head?"
msgstr "Super, es hat funktioniert.\nAber... musstest du auf meinem Kopf erscheinen?"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "No, but I like it that way.\nProblems?"
msgstr "Na, aber ich mag es so.\nProblem?"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "No, but… you weigh…"
msgstr "Nein, aber... du wiegst…"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "What are you insinuating?!"
msgstr "Was deutest du an?!"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Nothing…"
msgstr "Nichts…"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Great, then I'll appear on your head.\nSee ya!"
msgstr "Großartig, dann werd' ich auf deinem Kopf erscheinen.\nBis dann!"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Did you miss me already?\nLet me rest a bit."
msgstr "Vermisst du mich schon?\nLass mich ein wenig ausruhen."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Arghhhhh."
msgstr "Arghhhhh."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "M-Milla???"
msgstr "M-Milla???"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "M-Milla??!\nWhat did you do? How??? Where did you appear from?"
msgstr "M-Milla??!\nWas hast du getan? Wie??? Wo bist du hergekommen?"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "I saw that you were in trouble and helped you."
msgstr "Ich hab' gesehen, dass du in Schwierigkeiten bist und hab' dir geholfen."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Yes, but… how??\nYou appeared out of nowhere!\nOn my head!"
msgstr "Ja, aber... Wie??\nDu bist aus dem Nichts erschienen!\nAuf meinem Kopf!"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Well… maybe I forgot to tell you something the other times we met…\nI am a spirit."
msgstr "Nun... vielleicht habe ich dir vergessen etwas zu erzählen als wir uns bisher gesehen haben...\nIch bin ein Geist."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "A spirit?!"
msgstr "Ein Geist?!"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Yes… I am the Spirit of the Forest."
msgstr "Ja... Ich bin der Waldgeist."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Wait… what!?\nAre you the \"mystical protective creature of the Leaf Region and the Mitsu Forest\"?"
msgstr "Warte... was!?\nBist du die mystische schützende Kreatur der Blattregion und des Mitsuwaldes?"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Yes, that's what they call me… But I prefer \"Milla\"."
msgstr "Ja, so nennt man mich... Ich ziehe \"Milla\" vor."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "But why didn't you tell me? That was information you could have told me when we introduced ourselves…"
msgstr "Aber warum hast du mir das nicht gesagt? Diese Information hättest du mir mitteilen können, als wir uns kennengelernt haben…"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Ah, yes, sometimes I forget some details when I introduce myself.\nI like to sing, I forgot to tell you that as well."
msgstr "Ah, ja, manchmal vergesse ich einige Details, wenn ich mich jemandem vorstelle.\nIch singe gerne, das hab ich dir auch nicht gesagt."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Oh wait, it makes sense that you didn't give me this other information sooner."
msgstr "Warte mal... Es macht schon Sinn, dass du mir diese Information nicht früher gesagt hast."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Anyway I'm a bit confused… I always imagined the spirit was a little different.\nHow old are you? Do you have superpowers? Where do you come from? How many-"
msgstr "Ich bin jedenfalls etwas verwirrt... Ich hab´mir den Geist immer etwas anders vorgestellt.\nWie alt bist du? Hast du Superkräfte? Wo kommst du her? Wie viele-"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Too many! Too many questions hero!\nI'm just a mystical spirit! That's it.\nI will explain everything better to you during the journey!"
msgstr "Zu viele! Zu viele Fragen, Held!\nIch bin einfach ein mystischer Geist! Das ist alles.\nIch erkläre dir das alles noch besser, wenn wir unterwegs sind!"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "During the journey?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Yes, I have decided that from now on I will travel with you, so I can help you out.\nYou need me."
msgstr "Ja, ich hab mich entschlossen von nun an mit dir zu reisen, sodass ich dir helfen kann.\nDu brauchst mich."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "O-ok, thanks!\nI was getting a little bored traveling alone all the time."
msgstr "O-ok, danke!\nStändig alleine zu Reisen war etwas langweilig."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Great!\nSo it's decided! We will travel together!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "However, to save energy I will often stay in the spiritual realm. To call me just hold this leaf that I am giving you now and I will appear.\nTo do this, just click on the top right where there is the leaf icon!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Ok… ok…\nIt all seems so strange to me but it's okay."
msgstr "Ok... ok...\nDas kommt mir alles seltsam vor, aber in Ordnung."

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "Try calling me to see if you understand.\nNow I go to the spirit realm.\nByeeee!"
msgstr "Ruf´mich mal um zu sehen, ob du es verstanden hast.\nIch gehe jetzt in die Welt der Geister.\nBabaaa!"

#: assets/maps/story/48.tmx:
msgid "I should try calling Milla by clicking on the leaf icon at the top right of the screen."
msgstr "Ich sollte Milla rufen, indem ich auf das Blattsymbol rechts oben am Bildschirm tippe."

#: assets/maps/story/60.tmx:
msgid "I don't like boating."
msgstr "Ich mag Bootfahren nicht."

#: assets/maps/story/60.tmx:
msgid "I see you have the travel pass!\nDo you want to go to the Fire Region?"
msgstr "Wie ich sehe, hast du eine Reisegenehmigung!\nMöchtest du zur Feuerregion gehen?"

#: assets/maps/story/60.tmx:
msgid "I'm sorry, you need the travel pass to get on this boat."
msgstr "Es tut mir leid, aber du benötigst eine Reisegenehmigung um auf das Boot zu steigen."

#: assets/maps/story/60.tmx:
msgid "One day you will feel nostalgic about this moment."
msgstr "Eines Tages wirst du dich nostalgisch an diesen Moment erinnern."

#: assets/maps/story/60.tmx:
msgid "A boat named Pino."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "You're lucky, but it doesn't end here, guaranteed."
msgstr "Du hattest Glück, aber es ist noch nicht vorbei."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "You will not escape me."
msgstr "Du wirst mir nicht entkommen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I can't escape. I have to take the first signet."
msgstr "Ich komme nicht mehr raus. Ich muss das erste Siegel bekommen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Here it is, this is the first signet!"
msgstr "Da ist es, das erste Siegel!"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I can get out of here now."
msgstr "Endlich kann ich hier raus."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "The henchmen are after me! I'll get the signet later."
msgstr "Die Schergen sind hinter mir her! Ich werde das Siegel später holen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I didn't think you would get this far, kid."
msgstr "Ich hätte nicht gedacht, dass Du so weit kommst, Kindchen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "W-who are you?"
msgstr "W-Wer bist Du?"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm surprised that my name is not known among the woods of your village."
msgstr "Ich bin überrascht, dass mein Name in den Wäldern Deines Dorfes nicht bekannt ist."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "My name is Dr. Lache and I'm the leader of the Hoarfrost Team."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "So you're the one who spread terror and violence through the henchmen as ordered by the King of Evil?"
msgstr "Du bist also derjenige, der auf Geheiß des Königs des Bösen mit seinen Schergen Terror verbreitet?"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "As ordered by the King of Evil? HAHAHA"
msgstr "Auf Befehl des Königs des Bösen? HAHAHA"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I don't take orders from anyone. Between me and the King of Evil there is a peer collaboration."
msgstr "Ich nehme keine Befehle von irgendjemandem an. Zwischen mir und dem König des Bösen besteht eine gewisse Zusammenarbeit."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Be that as it may, I won't let you continue your plans."
msgstr "Auf jeden Fall werde ich nicht erlauben, dass Du mit Deinen Plänen weitermachen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm {{hero}}, I'm the chos-"
msgstr "Ich bin {{hero}}, ich bin der auserwä-"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
#, fuzzy
msgid "I know very well who you are, you're this year's chosen hero and blah, blah, blah.\nI don't have time for this."
msgstr "Ich weiß genau, wer Du bist, Du bist der auserwählte Held und blah, blah, blah.\nIch habe keine Zeit für so etwas."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I know you're interested in the signet, defeat my henchmen and it's yours.\nNow get out of my way."
msgstr "Ich weiß, dass Du an dem Siegel interessiert bist. Besiege meine Gefolgsleute und es gehört Dir.\nUnd jetzt geh mir aus dem Weg."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I won't let you go so eas-"
msgstr "So einfach lasse ich Dich nicht davonko-"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Well, well, well… you'll have to deal with us now."
msgstr "Sieh an, sieh an, sieh an...jetzt wirst Du Dich mit uns rumschlagen müssen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm Iosa."
msgstr "Ich bin Iosa."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "And I'm Joza."
msgstr "Und ich bin Joza."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "We are the Iosa&Joza brothers and we will be your worst nightmare."
msgstr "Wir sind die Gebrüder Iosa & Joza und Dein schlimmster Albtraum."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "I'm not scared of you, let's see what you are capable of!"
msgstr "Ich habe keine Angst vor euch. Los, zeigt was ihr könnt!"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Now you will see."
msgstr "Du wirst gleich sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "Let's fight!"
msgstr "Kämpfen wir!"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_06.tmx:
msgid "A rocky wall covered by moss."
msgstr "Eine steinige, moosbewachsene Wand."

#: assets/maps/story/38_house.tmx:
msgid "I just cooked a cake. Do you want some?"
msgstr "Ich habe gerade Kuchen gebacken. Möchtest Du ein Stück?"

#: assets/maps/story/38_house.tmx:
msgid "Here you go!"
msgstr "Hier, bitte!"

#: assets/maps/story/38_house.tmx:
msgid "* {{hero}} eats a piece of cake *"
msgstr "* {{hero}} isst ein Stück Kuchen *"

#: assets/maps/story/38_house.tmx:
msgid "Oh, ok. Then I'll eat it all."
msgstr "Oh, na gut. Dann ess ich ihn auf."

#: assets/maps/story/38_house.tmx:
msgid "I love cooking cakes and sweets."
msgstr "Ich liebe es, Kekse und Kuchen zu backen."

#: assets/maps/story/40.tmx:
msgid "Today I really can't find any fish."
msgstr "Heute beißt wirklich keiner an."

#: assets/maps/story/40.tmx:
msgid "But somehow I caught a pair of glasses. Do you want them?"
msgstr "Allerdings habe ich diese Brille gefunden, kannst Du was damit anfangen?"

#: assets/maps/story/40.tmx:
msgid "Oh, ok. Then I'll try to look for the owner."
msgstr "Oh, na gut. Dann werde ich versuchen, den Besitzer zu finden."

#: assets/maps/story/40.tmx:
msgid "Fishing is relaxing."
msgstr "Angeln ist total entspannend."

#: assets/maps/story/61.tmx:
msgid "Route 8"
msgstr "Route 8"

#: assets/maps/story/61.tmx:
msgid "Do you want to go to the Water Region?"
msgstr "Möchtest du zur Wasserregion?"

#: assets/maps/story/61.tmx:
msgid "Welcome to the Fire Region!"
msgstr "Willkommen in der Feuerregion!"

#: assets/maps/story/69.tmx:
msgid "This is the third capital of the Kingdom. What is your favorite?"
msgstr "Das ist die dritte Hauptstadt des Königreichs. Welche ist dein Liebling?"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Time seems to be short. Let's run!"
msgstr "Die Zeit scheint knapp zu sein. Laufen wir!"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Hey {{hero}}!"
msgstr "Hallo {{hero}}!"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Hi I'm Mil–"
msgstr "Hallo ich bin Mil–"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "{{hero}}, long time no see! Are you all right?"
msgstr "{{hero}}, lange nicht gesehen! Alles in Ordnung?"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Yes, everything is fine. I have ju–"
msgstr "Ja, alles ist in Ordnung. Ich habe nu–"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "I'm sorry, we don't have much time. The King of Evil is about to conclude his plan."
msgstr "Verzeih´, wir haben nicht viel Zeit. Der König des Bösen ist dabei seine Pläne zu vollenden."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "We know!\nWe met the Hoarfr–"
msgstr "Wissen wir!\nWir haben Team Rau–"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Tell me next time. Sorry."
msgstr "Erzähl´s mir nächstes mal. Entschuldige."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "How many signets do you have?"
msgstr "Wie viele Siegel hast du?"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "I have 2 signets, now I'm about to go get the third one."
msgstr "Ich habe jetzt zwei Siegel, und bin dabei das dritte zu holen."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Great! With the third we can enter the Xeonjia Tower."
msgstr "Großartig! Mit dem dritten können wir den Xeonjia-Turm betreten."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "We absolutely have to stop the Hoarfrost Team and the King of Evil."
msgstr "Wir müssen das Raureif-Team und den König des Bösen unbedingt aufhalten."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "That's right, we will stop them!\nI've def–"
msgstr "Stimmt, wir werden sie aufhalten!\nIch besie–"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "How many gems did you find?"
msgstr "Wie viele Juwelen hast du gefunden?"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "I don't know if they will be enough…"
msgstr "Ich weiß nicht, ob das genug sein werden…"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "By the way, hi, I'm Mil–"
msgstr "Übrigens, hallo, ich bin Mil–"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "We'll go to the tower with the ones we found.\nAlways keep your eyes open, the gems are often found in hidden places."
msgstr "Wir werden mit denen, die wir haben, zum Turm gehen.\nHalte die Augen offen, Juwelen finden sich oft an versteckten Orten."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "I'll pay attention, but it's not eas–"
msgstr "Ich werd' aufpassen, aber es ist nicht leic–"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Were the snowballs useful to you? I built this other weapon, here you go."
msgstr "Waren die Schneebälle hilfreich? Ich habe noch eine andere Waffe gebaut, hier bitte."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "* Shen gives MINES to {{hero}} *"
msgstr "* Shen gibt {{hero}} MIENEN*"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "They are Mines, during battles you can place them under you with the \"{{mine-key}}\" button.\nWhen an enemy walks over them, they explode and cause damage."
msgstr "Das sind Mienen. Während eines Kampfes kannst du sie mit dem \"{{mine-key}}\"-Knopf unter dir platzieren.\nWenn ein Feind darüber läuft, explodieren sie und verursachen Schaden."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Great thanks! They will sur–"
msgstr "Vielen Dank! Sie werden sicherl–"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "THEY WILL SURELY COME IN HANDY!"
msgstr "SIE WERDEN SICHERLICH NÜTZLICH SEIN!"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "I'm leaving now, see you soon!"
msgstr "Ich werde mich jetzt verabschieden, wir werden einander wiedersehen!"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Ok, see you Shen."
msgstr "Ok, bis dann, Shen."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Milla!\nI'm Milla!"
msgstr "Milla!\nIch bin Milla!"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Hi Milla, sorry, time is running out. We will have time to talk and introduce ourselves after defeating the King of Evil.\nOn our actions depends the future of all citizens of the Kingdom… We cannot fail…"
msgstr "Servus Milla, entschuldige, die Zeit wird knapp. Wir werden Zeit zum Reden und uns einander bekannt machen haben nachdem der König des Bösen besiegt worden ist.\nUnsere Handlungen bestimmen die Zukunft der Bürger des Königreichs... Wir dürfen nicht scheitern…"

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "Nice to meet you."
msgstr "Freut mich dich kennenzulernen."

#: assets/maps/story/58.tmx:
msgid "See you."
msgstr "Wir sehen einander."

#: assets/maps/story/49.tmx:
msgid "My roof burned.\nYes, okay, it keeps snowing in my house, but it's nice to be able to watch the sky."
msgstr "Mein Dach hat gebrannt.\nJa, gut, es schneit immer weiter in mein Haus, aber es ist auch nett den Himmel zu sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/49.tmx:
msgid "Well, this is / My final abode / The snow lay 1 meter."
msgstr "Nun, das ist / Meine letzter Aufenthalt / Der Schnee ist 1 Meter hoch."

#: assets/maps/story/49.tmx:
msgid "sheet-of-paper"
msgstr "Blatt Papier"

#: assets/maps/story/49.tmx:
msgid "Just being here / I am here / And the snow falls."
msgstr "Einfach hier zu sein / Ich bin hier/ Und der Schnee fällt."

#: assets/maps/story/49.tmx:
msgid "It's not a good thing to look into other people's homes."
msgstr "Es ist unangebracht, in die Häuser anderer Leute hineinzuschauen."

#: assets/maps/story/49.tmx:
msgid "Bitter winter wind / Ends there / Sound of the sea."
msgstr "Rauer Winterwind / Ended hier / Klang des Meeres."

#: assets/maps/story/49.tmx:
msgid "This is a common tree in this area."
msgstr "Dies ist ein häufiger Baum in dieser Gegend."

#: assets/maps/story/t3_04.tmx:
msgid "Hey, where's the signet?"
msgstr "He, wo ist das Siegel?"

#: assets/maps/story/t3_04.tmx:
msgid "There is no signet here!\nHow is that possible?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t3_04.tmx:
msgid "Did they forget to put it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t3_04.tmx:
msgid "I think someone else got it before us."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t3_04.tmx:
msgid "And now what do we do?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t3_04.tmx:
msgid "I don't know… I don't know…\nLet's continue our journey for now.\nWe'll decide what to do with Shen."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "This should be the crypt of this region. Here is the second signet."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "Yeaaah, let's go get it."
msgstr "Jaaa, los, holen wir es uns."

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "In the other crypt there were many monsters. We must be careful."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "I'll help you."
msgstr "Ich helf' dir."

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "To fight? Sure?\nOk thank you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "Look who's back again.\nThe \"hero\".\nAnd he even made a friend."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "Dr. Lache!\nI defeated your henchmen last time, now I will defeat you too."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "You have not defeated us."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "We were just trying to figure out what you were capable of."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "Either way, no one is here to fight.\nEverything is now ready for the completion of our work."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "What?!\nAre you ready to freeze the whole Kingdom?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "How do you know our plan???\nWere you the ones who told him?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "No sir!\nWe didn't say anything."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "It matters little.\nSoon this whole lousy Kingdom will be frozen and I'll be rich and blissful away from here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "You can't do this, I'll stop you!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "If you are as good as they say, see you at the Xeonjia Tower, otherwise goodbye \"chosen hero\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "Who were these guys? I do not like them."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "The henchmen of the Hoarfrost Team.\nThey want to freeze the whole Kingdom so that it will be livable for the King of Evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "Uh, bad story.\nBut you're definitely stronger than them, hero!\nLet's go save the world!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/52.tmx:
msgid "I have to go through the crypt to get the second signet."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/44.tmx:
msgid "Hey, you! What are you doing here?\nYou are not allowed to stay in this place!\nIf you don't leave immediately, we will have to remove you by force."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t2_02.tmx:
msgid "WATERY CRYPT – B2F"
msgstr "Wasserkrypta – 2. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/x3.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 3F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x3.tmx:
msgid "There are no monsters here, except for that guy over there who's kind of ugly."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x3.tmx:
msgid "Isn't there a guided tour?\nAh, isn't this a tourist attraction?\nThat explains many things…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x3.tmx:
msgid "At this point I do a tour of the tower.\nWhen do I get an opportunity like this again?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t3_02.tmx:
msgid "FIERY CRYPT – B2F"
msgstr "Feuerkrypta – 2. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_3.tmx:
msgid "Cringe."
msgstr "Unangenehm."

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_3.tmx:
msgid "The fun, the frustration, the dedication, the time spent.\nWhat it is and what could have been.\nI'm in it.\nI'm in everything.\nIn every person, in every monster, in every dialog, in every rock.\nI'm it.\nI'm the enigma.\nThe room you couldn't get out, the useless items, the inside jokes you will ever understand.\nI'm.\nI'm all that is not there.\nThe houses with closed doors, the unreachable areas, the untold stories of every secondary character.\nTheir dreams and aspirations.\nI'm the game. The whole and all its parts.\nAnd you played me for {{minutes-played}} minutes.\nAs your journey continues, remember that you are not just playing a game; you are living me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2_3.tmx:
msgid "Computers are not used from this side."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/3.tmx:
msgid "Sometimes among the branches of the plants you can find some berries.\nI also happened to find objects that have remained stuck."
msgstr "Manchmal findet man zwischen den Zweigen der Pflanzen einige Beeren.\nIch habe auch schon Gegenstände gefunden, die stecken geblieben sind."

#: assets/maps/story/3.tmx:
msgid "Oh, I was about to take those berries."
msgstr "Oh, ich wollte gerade diese Beeren nehmen."

#: assets/maps/story/3.tmx:
msgid "No problem, you can keep them."
msgstr "Kein Problem, Du kannst sie behalten."

#: assets/maps/story/3.tmx:
msgid "I hope those berries were good."
msgstr "Ich hoffe, die Beeren waren gut."

#: assets/maps/story/3.tmx:
msgid "The ice is so slippery, have you noticed?\nI feel more comfortable on the snow."
msgstr "Das Eis ist so rutschig, hat Du das bemerkt?\nIch fühle mich auf dem Schnee viel wohler."

#: assets/maps/story/3.tmx:
msgid "It seems that once there was a path here."
msgstr "Es scheint, dass hier einst ein Weg war."

#: assets/maps/story/19_house.tmx:
msgid "You are my only friend."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/19_house.tmx:
msgid "I would have liked to have friends."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/77_cableway.tmx:
msgid "Do you want to go back to the volcano?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "I feel at home."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "Welcome to DeepDaikon studios!\nWe are a bit busy at the moment."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "I did everything you see.\nI did you too."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "Good that you got here.\nYou donated some money to this project, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "Bravo! I hope you are not lying to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "I thought so. Very few people contributed."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "It took a long time but now we have finished building everything."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "Yes, I did!"
msgstr "Ja, habe ich getan!"

#: assets/maps/story/53_house2.tmx:
msgid "No…"
msgstr "Nein…"

#: assets/maps/story/43.tmx:
msgid "To reach the other shore you have to go through the submarine tunnel but is currently guarded by the Hoarfrost Team.\nIf they don't leave, I'll try to cross the sea with the boat."
msgstr "Du musst den Unterseetunnel benutzen, um auf die andere Seite zu kommen. Leider lässt das Raureif-Team gerade niemanden durch.\nWenn das so weitergeht, werde ich wohl versuchen, mit dem Boot rüberzufahren."

#: assets/maps/story/43.tmx:
msgid "To reach the other shore you have to go through the submarine tunnel."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/43.tmx:
msgid "I think I will spend the rest of my life here."
msgstr "Ich denke, ich werden den Rest meines Lebens hier verbringen."

#: assets/maps/story/43.tmx:
msgid "Wow! The view here is spectacular!"
msgstr "Wow! Die Aussicht hier ist atemberaubend!"

#: assets/maps/story/42.tmx:
msgid "Nope, there's only trash here."
msgstr "Schade, da ist nur Müll drin."

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 12F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "We did it?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "hero"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "And so, in the end, it really happened."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I just got defeated by 4 kids."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I didn't even fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Ah, right."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I just got defeated by 3 kids."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I had to leave my world because it was uninhabitable.\nFreezing your world was the only way to save me and my people.\nThere was no possibility of coexistence."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "But in this way, to avoid your own suffering you brought suffering to us."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I have been blind to the pain I have inflicted on this world and those who inhabit it.\nI was ready to freeze everything and wipe out every living thing in this Kingdom.\nThe power wore me down.\nBut I'd do it all over again the same way.\nI hope you will not be faced with similar choices."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "We would act differently."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I know."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I am leaving now, and with me the winter that has lasted for 65 years.\nRemember that even if my kingdom falls, evil will never completely disappear.\nIt will be reborn somewhere else, in a different form, waiting for a new opportunity to reclaim power.\nAlways be on your guard, heroes.\nFarewell."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "And so, so… it's over."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "So it seems."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "How pathetic the King of Evil trying to justify all the evil he has done."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "But… guys… it seems to me that it's still winter!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "You're right, it's still cold and the floor is still frozen!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Why isn't winter over?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Guys… do you know what day it is today?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Actually no… I've lost track of time for quite a while.\nI think it has been at least a year since the start of the journey."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Today is December 22nd… winter has just begun!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Hehe so we still have 3 months of winter ahead."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Yea."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "All right, after 65 years of winter, 3 more months don't make much of a difference."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Now what do we do?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "We go back home."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "There will be a sequel, right?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I guess not."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "No!??\nPlease."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "It's not up to me."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I want to have many more adventures.\nLet's save the world again, please."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "From what? The world is safe now."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "We need a new villain!\nSeptember, do you want to do this?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "My glacial domain is about to begin."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "evil september"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Yeaaah. Thanks!!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "You know I was kidding, right?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "It doesn't matter."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Shall we go eat an ice cream?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Yeaaah."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "What's wrong, Milla?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Snowball fight!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Hey, there's September!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Don't disturb me, I'm planning the trip."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Here we are, finally!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Why do you waste your moves like this?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Let's go!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "What's this thing?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I don't know, it looks like a cluster of gems."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "How ugly.\nAnd why is it here?\nMost importantly… where is the King of Evil?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "This is a good question."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "HA HA."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "In all this time, haven't you figured it out?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Figured it out what?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "How naive."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "It's me, the King of Evil!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "What?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Eternal winter is almost here. The Ice Kingdom will rise today!\nMy plan is about to come true also thanks to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I brought you here because…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I can't go on without laughing, just kidding hehe."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "…\nWhat a funny girl."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I almost believed it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "You totally fell for it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "You're good at playing the King of Evil, it's a role that suits you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "You say?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Yes! Keep that in mind for next time."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Did I miss something?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "The King of Evil is not here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "evil shen"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I already made this joke a little while ago."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Ah, what a pity."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "What's this?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "It looks like a cluster of gems."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Yes you are right!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "They're the gems that the King of Evil wants to use as an energy source to complete the freezing of the Kingdom.\nIf everything is ready to complete the plan, it means that they have enough gems."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Finally.\nI am happy that you are here, so you can witness the end of your Kingdom."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "The King of Evil!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I hate being called \"King of Evil\".\nThis is the name you stupid inhabitants of this stupid Kingdom gave me.\nMy real name is King Tradraprara."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Tradra–what??"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "TRA-DRA-PRA-RA."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "It's even more unpronounceable than \"Xeonjia\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "It's not that difficult."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Anyway, here we are. Everything is almost ready."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Hey, I said the exact same sentences before!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I told you you're good as a King of Evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Tratradadadadra."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "STOP INTERRUPTING ME AND DON'T MAKE FUN OF ME!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "The planet I come from is no longer habitable, but this one is almost perfect.\nThe only problem is the temperature which is too high.\nBut now I have enough gems.\nWith the gems found by the Hoarfrost Team, I'm {{required_gems}} gems away, but I know that Shen has 2 and you {{hero}} have {{gem_count}} gems.\nMore than enough for my needs."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "So you used us to collect gems?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Exactly.\nWhat were you thinking of doing with them?\nAnd I'll tell you more: the whole signet thing was to  make you go around the Kingdom in order to increase the probability of finding gems.\nOtherwise you would have come straight to the tower without bringing me any."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "But we needed the signets to enter the tower, we should have taken them anyway."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Actually, it was enough to knock on the door of the tower and we would have opened."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Ah.\nIt matters little. I am this year's chosen hero and together with m–"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Even the \"hero\" thing is a joke."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "But, but… the legend of the chosen hero…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I made up the legend.\nEvery year ONE hero is chosen because otherwise if hundreds of people tried to defeat me it would be more complicated to get rid of them all.\nIndeed, this year that you've come this far in 4 you're more annoying."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Honestly I don't care about legends, heroes, signets or even gems.\nDuring this extraordinary adventure I've learned a lot and lived invaluable experiences. In some moments I suffered, I admit it, but it was worth it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Everything that has happened has contributed significantly to my maturation and growth."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Most importantly, I got to know fantastic people.\nThe energy that unites us is stronger than the energy of a thousand gems and the warmth of our friendship can counteract even the coldest winter."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "What banal, empty and unnecessarily pompous phrases."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I agree."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Please, {{hero}}, stop."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "In the harmonious symphony of human existence, friendship stands as the refined motif that weaves the notes of affection into a spiral of timeless emotions."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Is getting worse.\nQuick! Somebody do something!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I propose to let Shen speak instead of {{hero}}."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Proposal approved."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Sorry, these are the last dialogues of the story, there must be something impressing and memorable."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "The only memorable thing here is just boredom.\nFight?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Yes, the time to fight has come.\nThe unrelenting cold of my wrath will embrace every corner of this world and everything will be enveloped in eternal winter.\nMy glacial domination is about to begin, and you will watch the dawn of this new era while your hopes turn into frozen tears."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "You didn't interrupt him though."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I liked his speech."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Your copes turn into chosen fears."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I don't recall him saying that."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Your soaps turn into frozen pears."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Mmh… It wasn't even like that."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Fight?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Let's fight."
msgstr "Kämpfen wir."

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "The Ice Kingdom will rise today."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "{{hero}}! Milla!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Are you training to become the new King of Evil?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Don't call me that. I hate being called \"new King of Evil\"."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I'm bored. I'm walking around here because I didn't know what to do."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Are you also struggling with being a hero in a world without a villain?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Sequel! Sequel! Sequel!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "No Milla, no."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "We just have to find new things to do and hobbies.\nI'm thinking about photography."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Cool! I'm thinking about drawing."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "What do you think if we organize a trip?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Where?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Outside the Kingdom!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Dunno, let's find out!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I'm so bored that you convinced me!\nLet's do it!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Yeaaa!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "But do you know that this journey will not be covered by this or any other game?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "We will still live it even if no one sees us."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "How much wisdom."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I invite Shen as well. And the Spirit of Water."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Do you also invite the Spirit of Fire?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Ok…"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Good."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I'm so happy! I'm going to organize the trip. Byeee!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "I don't know if it's a good idea to go on a trip organized by her."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "It will be an interesting adventure."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "That's for sure."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/999_up.tmx:
msgid "Lots of free time now, huh?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/t3_03.tmx:
msgid "FIERY CRYPT – B3F"
msgstr "Feuerkrypta – 3. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_01.tmx:
msgid "MOSSY CRYPT – B1F"
msgstr "Moosbewachsene Krypta – 1. UG"

#: assets/maps/story/t1_01.tmx:
msgid "I advise you not to continue, you are running into big trouble.\nI'll report your presence to my boss."
msgstr "Ich rate Dir, nicht weiterzugehen. Du wirst große Schwierigkeiten bekommen.\nIch werde Dich bei meinem Meister melden."

#: assets/maps/story/t1_01.tmx:
msgid "If you decide to continue you will regret it."
msgstr "Du wirst es bereuen, hier weiterzugehen."

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "Route 1"
msgstr "Route 1"

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "Hey, I found this stone near here.\nHere's to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "This is a very strange stone… Never seen anything like this before."
msgstr "Das ist ein sehr eigenartiger Stein… So etwas habe ich noch nie zuvor gesehen."

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "I also often get hurt by rocks.\nIt's annoying but you'll get used to it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "Ouch!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "Are you okay?\nI heard you screaming."
msgstr "Geht es dir gut?\nIch habe Dich schreien gehört."

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "Y-yes, I hurt myself by bumping into this rock!\nI just lost 15 health points."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "I know, it happens often.\nToday you are the third.\nSome rocks are very sharp and pointy.\nYou get hurt when you bump into them."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "Now I know!\nI'll be careful from now on."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/2.tmx:
msgid "During your journey you will run into them many times, it's not a problem.\nSometimes you can't even avoid them.\nJust be careful not to run out of HP."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x9.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 9F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x9.tmx:
msgid "Arrows, arrows. Arrows again."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x9.tmx:
msgid "Just a little more effort and we'll make it."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/41.tmx:
msgid "As long as the tunnel is blocked we must organize differently to get goods and people from one side to another."
msgstr "Solange der Tunnel gesperrt ist, müssen wir Waren und Leute anders von einer Seite auf die andere befördern."

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab_2.tmx:
msgid "VANTOI LAB – 2F"
msgstr "VANTOI LAB – 1. OG"

#: assets/maps/story/24_lab_2.tmx:
msgid "What a mess! I have to tidy up!"
msgstr "Was für ein Chaos! Ich muss das aufräumen!"

#: assets/maps/story/31.tmx:
msgid "Some boulders are placed by us, the workers of the Kingdom.\nIn this way it's easier to reach all places."
msgstr "Einige Steine wurden von uns, den Mitarbeitern des Königreichs, gelegt.\nAuf diese Weise ist es einfacher, alle Orte zu erreichen."

#: assets/maps/story/10.tmx:
msgid "Souvenir shop"
msgstr "Andenkenladen"

#: assets/maps/story/10.tmx:
msgid "I can see the inside of the shop."
msgstr "Ich kann das Innere des Ladens sehen."

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 1F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "* The Spirit of Fire warmed the tower *"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "Here we are finally! It's time to save the world!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "The temperature is great here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "What were you thinking about?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "I can't wait to defeat the King of Evil."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "We have no time to waste!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "If there are monsters I hide, I don't like to fight."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "Yeahhh!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "Am I really in the tower? I still don't believe it…\nAfter this long journey…\nEverything I've been through has prepared me for this moment.\nI can no longer hesitate, I can't look back.\nLet the last challenge begin!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "Come on, {{hero}}! Move! What are you waiting for?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "Yes, sorry, I'm coming!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "The door is closed. I can't open it.\nAnyway, it's not the time to run away."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x1.tmx:
msgid "There is something behind this rock… It's a stone!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house3.tmx:
msgid "We are moving to a new location."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house3.tmx:
msgid "I don't think it fits through the door."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/70_house3.tmx:
msgid "But do we really need this?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/4.tmx:
msgid "On the ground it's easy to find XEON ¤ stones that you can use to buy items in shops."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/31_house2.tmx:
msgid "Greentwig City is the administrative center of the region.\nNowadays corruption, poverty and crime are rampant, though."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/x6.tmx:
msgid "XEONJIA TOWER – 6F"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Hey, this is the Mitsu Forest!\nMy parents told me many stories about how beautiful it was a long time ago.\nIt is said that once upon a time the mystical protective creature of this region lived here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Mitsu Forest!"
msgstr "Mitsuwald!"

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Remember that hydration is essential for good overall health."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Here's to you."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Ah, this forest is a true paradise for a botany enthusiast like me!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "student"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Look at those plants!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "And have you seen those?!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "This one?"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "And those!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "I love this place!"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "The trees of this region are admired and studied throughout the Kingdom.\nThese blue ones are my favorite."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Mitsu Forest – Welcome, respect nature and remember to take a look at the souvenir shop on the right."
msgstr "Mitsuwald – Willkommen, respektiere die Natur und vergiss nicht, den Andenkenladen auf der rechten Seite zu besuchen."

#: assets/maps/story/5.tmx:
msgid "Once this was a very touristy place, the Kingdom tried to make money from it."
msgstr "In der Vergangenheit war es ein sehr touristischer Ort. Das Königreich versuchte, Profit daraus zu schlagen."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/tower.tsx:
msgid "A cluster of gems."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/tilesets/tower.tsx:
msgid "Is still here."
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/tilesets/tower.tsx:
msgid "The tower is so ugly."
msgstr "Dieser Turm ist so hässlich."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/tower.tsx:
msgid "This is a wall."
msgstr "Das ist eine Wand."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/tower.tsx:
msgid "king of evil"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "A table."
msgstr "Ein Tisch."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "A stool."
msgstr "Ein Hocker."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "Test tubes and other scientific stuff."
msgstr "Reagenzgläser und anderes wissenschaftliches Zeug."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "Hey, there's a fruit juice here!\n* {{hero}} puts FRUIT JUICE in the backpack *"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "…\nNo… I think I'm stealing it.\n* {{hero}} puts FRUIT JUICE back on the shelf *"
msgstr ""

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "I'm not even sure it's a fruit juice."
msgstr "Ich bin nicht mal sicher, ob es Fruchtsaft ist."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "Better not to touch anything."
msgstr "Ich fasse besser nichts an."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "Someone has turned everything upside down."
msgstr "Jemand hat alles auf den Kopf gestellt."

#: assets/maps/tilesets/lab.tsx:
msgid "Someone spilled a green liquid here."
